ncy between Story (|story name|) and its (|src or dst|). (|relation info|)\":\"(|operator|) deleted the dependency between #Story# (|story_name|) and its (|src_or_dst|). (|relation_info|)\",\"(|operator|) changed the dependency between Story (|story name|) and its (|src or dst|) from (|before relation name|) to (|after relation name|). (|relation info|)\":\"(|operator|) changed the dependency between #Story# (|story_name|) and its (|src_or_dst|) from (|before_relation_name|) to (|after_relation_name|). (|relation_info|)\",\"(|operator|) created dependency between Story (|story name|) and its (|src or dst|). (|relation info|)\":\"(|operator|) created dependency between #Story# (|story_name|) and its (|src_or_dst|). (|relation_info|)\",\"[TAPD Story] (|operation field|) of predecessor story changed\":\"[TAPD #Story#] (|operation_field|) of predecessor #story# changed\"},\"devops\":{\"tgit\":\"TGit\",\"gitlab\":\"GitLab\",\"github\":\"GitHub\",\"fill authentication information desc\":\"Fill in the Application ID and secret in the pop-up window, and verify the network connection of the privatized instance.After all steps are completed, the authentication is completed\",\"Integrate mainstream R&D tools to help teams deliver value efficiently and continuously\":\"Integrate mainstream R&D tools to help teams deliver value efficiently and continuously\",\"DevOps continuous delivery\":\"DevOps continuous delivery\",\"Deeply integrated with mainstream R&D tools in the industry\":\"Deeply integrated with mainstream R&D tools in the industry\",\"Supports leading R&D tools like GitLab, GitHub, and Jenkins, offering visual management of delivery pipelines and seamless integration with R&D toolchains\":\"Supports leading R&D tools like GitLab, GitHub, and Jenkins, offering visual management of delivery pipelines and seamless integration with R&D toolchains\",\"TAPD Pipeline\":\"TAPD Pipeline\",\"Feedback\":\"Feedback\",\"Design\":\"Design\",\"Code management\":\"Code management\",\"Continuous integration\":\"Continuous integration\",\"Code inspection\":\"Code inspection\",\"Automated test\":\"Automated test\",\"Release\":\"Release\",\"WeCom\":\"\\u4f01\\u4e1a\\u5fae\\u4fe1\",\"Tencent Meeting\":\"Tencent Meeting\",\"Tencent Docs\":\"Tencent Docs\",\"Deep integration of project management and engineering practice\":\"Deep integration of project management and engineering practice\",\"TAPD deeply associates demands, defects, tasks, code, pipelines, and other engineering objects, enabling real-time tracking of the entire software delivery process.\":\"TAPD deeply associates demands, defects, tasks, code, pipelines, and other engineering objects, enabling real-time tracking of the entire software delivery process.\",\"Automation helps accelerates collaboration\":\"Automation helps accelerates collaboration\",\"Leverage Automation to drive and connect every phase of software delivery, reducing manual operations, avoiding process bottlenecks, and safeguarding efficient delivery.\":\"Leverage Automation to drive and connect every phase of software delivery, reducing manual operations, avoiding process bottlenecks, and safeguarding efficient delivery.\",\"Professional statistical analysis for efficiency metrics and continuous improvement\":\"Professional statistical analysis for efficiency metrics and continuous improvement\",\"For the purpose of project management, integrate business data with R&D engineering data to provide data support for the measurement of business development efficiency and continuous improvement.\":\"For the purpose of project management, integrate business data with R&D engineering data to provide data support for the measurement of business development efficiency and continuous improvement.\",\"Support for open access to self-built tools\":\"Support for open access to self-built tools\",\"Offer an open access solution that allows for the integration of enterprise-owned code management, compilation and construction, deployment and release, and other services.\":\"Offer an open access solution that allows for the integration of enterprise-owned code management, compilation and construction, deployment and release, and other services.\",\"Achieve integration of your own toolchain with minimal coding effort.\":\"Achieve integration of your own toolchain with minimal coding effort.\",\"Development guidance\":\"Development guidance\"},\"document\":{\"MY FAVORITE\":\"Followed\",\"PROJECT FILE\":\"Project Files\",\"MY COMMENT\":\"Commented\",\"All Files\":\"All Files\",\"This document does not exist.\":\"This file does not exist.\",\"This mindmap has been removed.\":\"Mindmap deleted.\",\"FILE LIST\":\"All Files\",\"MY CREATE\":\"Created\",\"This word has been removed.\":\"Document deleted.\",\"PERSONAL FILE\":\"Personal Files\",\"file\":\"Files\",\"No edit permission in this workspace\":\"No permission to create documents under this project.\",\"Choose word to update\":\"Select the document to be updated.\",\"folder not exist!\":\"Folder does not exist.\",\"Are you sure delete this comment ?\":\"Are you sure to delete this comment?\",\"My Document - TAPD\":\"Personal Files - TAPD Platform\",\"Update to word\":\"Update to Document\",\"No edit permission\":\"You have no permission to edit documents.\",\"Document is not enabled in this project\":\"Document not enabled for this project.\",\"Transfer to new word\":\"Generate Another Document\",\"update file error!\":\"Failed to update documents.\",\"Release to Project\":\"Release to Project\",\"update folder error!\":\"Failed to update folders.\",\"Document - TAPD\":\"Document - TAPD Platform\",\"Invite Partner\":\"Invite Co-Creator\",\"request param error!\":\"Request parameter error.\",\"file not exist!\":\"Document does not exist.\",\"No add bug permission\":\"You have no permission to create bugs.\",\"Story is not enabled in this project\":\"#Stories# not enabled for this project.\",\"Bug is not enabled in this project\":\"Bugs not enabled fo