acklog\":\"Create #Story# for Backlog\",\"Visually show the demand status under iteration\":\"Visual presentation of #story# status in the iteration.\",\"Understand the whole lifecycle of Agile\":\"Learn About Agile Full Lifecycle\",\"Intuitively show the demand status under iteration, and support dragging\":\"Visual presentation of #story# status in the iteration, with drag and drop supported.\",\"Set clear goals for the iteration and determine the start and end time of the iteration\":\"Set clear targets, start date and end date for the iteration.\",\"To visually view the progress of the work item, you can drag the card to the corresponding stage (plate)\":\"You can view the progress of each workitem and drag cards to relevant phases (sessions).\",\"Retrospective meeting\":\"Retrospective Meeting\",\"Review of the meeting\":\"Meeting Retrospection\",\"Customize the plate name as needed\":\"Customize session name as needed.\",\"Visually check the work status and follow up the work progress\":\"You can view work status intuitively to follow up work progress.\",\"Tracking defect\":\"Track Bugs\",\"Conduct a test\":\"Perform Test\",\"Create work items\":\"Create Workitems\",\"Create cards under the section and add work items\":\"Create cards and add workitems in the session.\",\"Test according to the test cases planned by the test plan\":\"Perform tests based on the test cases in the test plan.\",\"Statistical analysis of defect data to help the team understand the quality of iterations\":\"Perform statistical analysis of bug data to help the team learn about iteration quality.\",\"Use documents to precipitate team wisdom\":\"Use Document to gather creative ideas of your team.\",\"In Kanban, you can define how and how to use Kanban according to the needs of the team.\":\"In Board, a team can define the usage and sessions as needed.\",\"Custom usage\":\"Custom Usages\",\"Create work items and assign deadlines to the person in charge\":\"Create workitems and set deadlin