[#release type#] #title# [#workspace name#]\":\"[TAPD Launchform] Submit for signature: [#release_type#] #title# [#workspace_name#]\",\"Review list update:[#release type#]#title#[#workspace name#]\":\"[TAPD Launchform] Review list update:[#release_type#]#title#[#workspace_name#]\",\"confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"[Reminder] A new comment has been added to the task you follow.\":\"[TAPD Task] A new comment has been added to the task you follow\",\"Your company\\u2019s #company#\\u2019s TAPD Enterprise Edition trial service will expire in <span class=\\\"expired-date\\\">#expire date#<\\/span>. Please contact the TAPD Assistant to initiate the renewal process. If you do not process it, you cannot continue to use the TAPD Enterprise Edition service. For questions, please contact business@tapd.cn or call the hotline: 95716.\":\"The TAPD Enterprise Edition trial service of your company #company# will expire on <span class=\\\"expired-date\\\">#expire_date#<\\/span>. Please contact the TAPD assistant for renewal. Your failure to renew the TAPD service by the deadline will cause your inability to continue the use of the service. For any questions, email to business@tapd.cn or call 95716.\",\"Null\":\"Empty\",\"[TAPD] The service account will be deleted.\":\"[TAPD] The service account will be deleted\",\"Not empty\":\"Is Not Empty\",\"Approval member nickname exists with the same name, failed to add member\":\"Approval member nickname exists with the same name, failed to add member.\",\"The number of company members reached the limit, failed to add members\":\"The number of company members reached the limit, failed to add members.\",\"The custom field location of the template project is occupied in the target project, and the common spaces in the target workspace are automatically selected for you. After the copy is successful, you need to rearrange the requirements custom fields in the template workspace. Warning: do not execute this script if the template workspace is already a template for another project group\":\"The custom field location of the template project is occupied in the target project, and the common spaces in the target workspace are automatically selected for you. After the copy is successful, you need to rearrange the requirements custom fields in the template workspace. Warning: do not execute this script if the template workspace is already a template for another project group.\",\"The demand source that is set as the default is selected as the default demand source when creating the demand. If a template is used to create a requirement, the settings in the requirements template will override this default setting\":\"The demand source that is set as the default is selected as the default demand source when creating the demand. If a template is used to create a requirement, the settings in the requirements template will override this default setting.\",\"Passwords are required to be 8 to 16 digits in length and must contain numbers, uppercase letters and lowercase letters\":\"Passwords are required to be 8 to 16 digits in length and must contain numbers, uppercase letters and lowercase letters.\",\"It is derived from Tencent's agile product research and development collaboration platform, which provides one-stop service throughout the life cycle of agile research and development. It covers the whole life cycle of product development from product concept formation, product planning, requirements analysis, project planning and tracking, quality testing to construction release and user feedback tracking, providing flexible customizable applications and strong integration capabilities. help R & D teams effectively manage requirements, resources, schedule and quality, standardize and improve product R & D processes, and improve R & D efficiency and product quality\":\"It is derived from Tencent's agile product research and development collaboration platform, which provides one-stop service throughout the life cycle of agile research and development. It covers the whole life cycle of product development from product concept formation, product planning, requirements analysis, project planning and tracking, quality testing to construction release and user feedback tracking, providing flexible customizable applications and strong integration capabilities. help R & D teams effectively manage requirements, resources, schedule and quality, standardize and improve product R & D processes, and improve R & D efficiency and product quality.\",\"Best practices of efficient R & D collaboration, Tencent team collaboration concept and Agile R & D essence\":\"Best practices of efficient R & D collaboration, Tencent team collaboration concept and Agile R & D essence.\",\"How to deal with enterprise data after the trial expires\":\"How to deal with enterprise data after the trial expires?\",\"How to make a purchase on Tencent's official website\":\"How to make a purchase on Tencent's official website?\",\"How to buy through WeChat Work market\":\"How to buy through WeChat Work market?\",\"Placing an order error how to cancel an order\":\"Placing an order error how to cancel an order?\",\"Father\":\"Parent\",\"When the following events occur\":\"Triggers\",\"And the following conditions are met\":\"Additional Conditions\",\"Do the following\":\"Actions\",\"OK\":\" line\",\"The first\":\"The \",\"KM Help Center\":\"TAPD Help Center\",\"Your company #company#\\u2019s TAPD Enterprise Edition trial service has expired and has been downgraded to the Professional Edition for you. The Enterprise Edition features will no longer be available. If you need to continue to use the enterprise version of the service, please contact the TAPD consultant to initiate the renewal process. If you have any questions, please contact business@tapd.cn or call the hotline: 0755-86013388 to 819049.\":\"The TAPD Enterprise Edition trial service of your company #company# has expired. Your service has been downgraded to the Pro Edition and the Enterprise Edition features will not be available. If you want to continue using the Enterprise Edition, contact the TAPD assistant for a renewal. For any questions, email to business@tapd.cn or call the service hotline 0755-86013388-819049.\",\"Your company #company#\\u2019s TAPD Enterprise Edition trial service has expired and has been downgraded to the Professional Edition for you. The Enterprise Edition features will no longer be available. If you need to continue to use the enterprise service, please contact the TAPD assistant to initiate the renewal process. If you have any questions, please contact business@tapd.cn or call the hotline: 95716.\":\"The TAPD Enterprise Edition trial service of your company #company# has expired. Your service has been downgraded to the Pro Edition and the Enterprise Edition features will not be available. If you want to continue using the Enterprise Edition, contact the TAPD assistant for a renewal. For any questions, email to business@tapd.cn or call 95716.\",\"Your company\\u2019s TAPD enterprise service will expire on <span class=\\\"expired-date\\\">#expire date#<\\/span>. Please contact your account manager to initiate the renewal process. If you don\\u2019t renew after the expiration date, you cannot continue to use the TAPD service. If you have any questions, please contact business@tapd.cn or call the hotline: 0755-86013388 to 819049.\":\"The TAPD Enterprise Edition service of your company is about to expire on <span class=\\\"expired-date\\\">#expire_date#<\\/span>. Please contact the account manager for a renewal. Your failure to renew the TAPD service before the expiration date will cause your inability to continue using the service. For any questions, email to business@tapd.cn or call the service hotline 0755-86013388-819049.\",\"TAPD Assistant initiated a private chat to your [#title#].\":\"TAPD personal bot initiated a private chat to your [#title#].\",\"At most #num# label(s)\":\"At most #num# label(s)\",\