ting\",\"Support for the whole process of compilation, build, test management, deployment and release\":\"compilation build, test management, deployment and release\",\"Local management of core data\":\"Local management of core data\",\"Requirements planning, iteration tracking, code management\":\"#story# planning, iteration tracking, code management,\",\"Copywriting\":\"Copywriting\",\"Support efficiency measurement and continuous improvement\":\"to support efficiency measurement and ongoing improvement\",\"Record lifecycle software delivery data\":\"Record software delivery data throughout the entire lifecycle\",\"Real-time access to pipeline information\":\"and real-time acquisition of pipeline information.\",\"There are other errors in the nickname\":\"Another error occurs in alias\",\"Provide visual delivery pipeline management\":\"Provide visualized delivery pipeline management\",\"The continuous integration tools provided by Gitlab support the rapid construction of integrated environment and the automation of building software projects.\":\"A continuous integration tool provided by Gitlab to support quick setup of integrated environment and automated building of software projects\",\"TAPD defect management and statistics support comprehensive evaluation of development quality, problem tracking and bug repair\":\"TAPD bug management and statistical features to support evaluation of development quality, problem tracking, and bug fixing\",\"Due to the restriction of WeChat Work, please use the system browser to open it and download it.\":\"Due to WeCom restrictions, please open via browser to download.\",\"The nickname is already in the application queue for modification and will take effect the next day. There is no need to modify it repeatedly.\":\"The alias is in the change request queue, which will take effect the next day. Do not change again.\",\"Identify design requirements\":\"Understand Design Requirements\",\"Demand Review & scheduling\":\"#Story# Review & Scheduling\",\"Sorry, there's something wrong with the server.\":\"Server error.\",\"Demand gathering\":\"#Story# Collection\",\"The nickname is a system reserved word\":\"The alias contains system reserved words.\",\"Vacation information statistics\":\"Leave Statistics\",\"Relevant personnel examination and approval\":\"Approval by Related Member\",\"WeChat Work has enabled other versions of TAPD\":\"Another version of TAPD has been enabled in WeCom.\",\"Submit an application for leave\":\"Submit Leave Request\",\"Demand analysis\":\"#Story# Analysis\",\"Operation path: upper right corner \\\".\\\"-& gt; is opened through the browser\":\"Tap \\\"...\\\" in the upper right corner -> open in a browser.\",\"Conduct online review\":\"Perform Online Review\",\"Document details\":\"Document Details\",\"Demand follow-up\":\"#Story# Follow-up\",\"Assign design tasks\":\"Assign Design Task\",\"Manage design files\":\"Manage Design Files\",\"Issue and issue\":\"Release Signature\",\"Sorry, I can't access the project.\":\"You cannot access the project.\",\"After completing the account association between WeChat Work and TAPD, you can use it on WeChat Work.\":\"Link WeCom account with TAPD account to use TAPD in WeCom\",\"Sorry, the project has been migrated and cannot be accessed\":\"Project migrated. Unable to access.\",\"Sorry, the project you visited is being migrated\":\"The project is being migrated.\",\"Agile R & D project [example]\":\"Agile Development Project [Example]\",\"The project has been closed\":\"Project closed\",\"Honor of Kings\":\"King of Glory\",\"Please contact your TAPD account\":\"Link your TAPD account.\",\"Background engineer\":\"Backend Engineer\",\"Click me to log in\":\"Click here to log in\",\"I'll show you around in a minute.\":\"Get started quickly with\",\"Team collaboration project [example]\":\"Team Collaboration Project [Example]\",\"Account association notification\":\"Account Link Notification\",\"Invitation notice\":\"Invitation No