nce competitiveness.\",\"After improvement, you will be able to log in through your mobile phone and email and use TAPD, to receive work updates and further ensure the security of your account.\":\"By completing your information, you can log in to TAPD and receive work notifications on your phone or via email and further ensure your account security.\",\"TAPD-Sell funnel solution\":\"Sales Funnel Solution\",\"Efficient R & D collaboration platform, Tencent team collaboration concept and agile R & D essence precipitation.\":\"Built on Tencent's years of experience in agile development to offer an efficient development collaboration platform\",\"TAPD help the team to clearly follow up the customer transformation process, update customer status, improve customer information, and promote customer transformation.\":\"helps teams follow up customer conversion progress, update customer status, and complete customer information to promote customer conversion.\",\"TAPD-Bug management solution\":\"Management Solution\",\"TAPD-New employee management solution\":\"New Employee Management Solution\",\"TAPD support the team to use multiple terminals to manage the employee vacation process and reduce the cost of team communication.\":\"Teams can manage leave process on various terminals to reduce communication cost.\",\"TAPD help the team to keep abreast of the progress of requirements, follow up the allocation of project resources, and improve the efficiency of team cooperation.\":\"helps teams learn about #story# progress, follow up project resource allocation, and improve collaboration efficiency.\",\"One-stop continuous delivery, reliable construction and release of products, rapid delivery of user value\":\"One-stop continuous delivery helps your team build and release reliable products efficiently and deliver value to users quickly.\",\"The authorized person is not within the scope of authorization.\":\"Authorized By is not an authorized user.\",\"Help the team to manage defects quickly, accurately and efficiently and improve product quality\":\"Help your team manage bugs in a quick, accurate, and efficient manner to improve product quality.\",\"TAPD-Agile R & D solution\":\"Agile Development Solution\",\"Issue and issue notice\":\"Release Signature Notification\",\"To be done\":\"To-Dos\",\"TAPD-Requirements management solution\":\"#Story# Management Solution\",\"TAPD realize the whole process management of team design and promote team cooperation efficiently.\":\"helps teams achieve the management of the entire design process to improve collaboration efficiency.\",\"TAPD agile development Kanban, with the needs of users as the core, adopts an iterative and step-by-step method to manage the whole process of software development.\":\"agile development board, by placing user #stories# at the core, adopts an iterative and phased-in approach to manage the full lifecycle of software development.\",\"Solve all kinds of problems in the use of TAPD and grow up with you\":\"Solve all problems related to TAPD to drive your growth\",\"TAPD-Vacation management solution\":\"Leave Management Solution\",\"Team wall\":\"Team Wall\",\"R & D Management Department\":\"Development Management Department\",\"TAPD help the team standardize the whole process management from the determination of copywriting theme, material collection, copywriting, manuscript review to release and launch.\":\"helps teams standardize the management of the full process involving topic determination, material collection, copywriting, review, and go-live.\",\"Platform department\":\"Platform Department\",\"Authorization code expired or invalid\":\"Authorization code expired or invalid.\",\"The administrator did not set the mobile phone number or the format is incorrect.\":\"No mobile number set by the admin or incorrect mobile number format.\",\"[WeChat Work] Synchronize script alarm every night\":\"[WeCom] Sync script alerts every night\",\"Issue a review notice\":\"Release Revie