re Group\",\"Related CE feedback\":\"Associate CE Feedback\",\"Iterative demand score\":\"Iteration #Story# Score\",\"Iterative development quality\":\"Iteration Development Quality\",\"One-click calculation\":\"One-click Calculation\",\"Defect inspection\":\"View Bugs\",\"To be verified\":\"To be Verified\",\"Demand test point\":\"#Story# Test Point\",\"Demand defect hit back score\":\"#Story# Bug Rejection Score\",\"Unassigned\":\"Unassigned\",\"Development quality\":\"Development Quality\",\"Reminder] the scheduled report you set will be sent\":\"Notification] The scheduled report you set will be sent.\",\"Architecture Service feature Group\":\"Architecture Service Feature Group\",\"Total demand score\":\"Total #Story# Score\",\"Open platform group\":\"Open Platform Group\",\"Defect addition\":\"Add Bug\",\"Mobile terminal property group\":\"Mobile Feature Group\",\"Iterative view\":\"View Iteration\",\"Iterative creation\":\"Create Iteration\",\"Test case list\":\"Test Case List\",\"Task editing\":\"Edit Task\",\"Demand View\":\"View #Story#\",\"Test case view\":\"View Test Case\",\"Release Review creation\":\"Create Release Review\",\"Requirements editing\":\"Edit #Story#\",\"Release Review View\":\"View Release Review\",\"Publish review list\":\"Release Review List\",\"Defect statistics list\":\"Bug List\",\"Defect advanced query\":\"Advanced Search of Bugs\",\"Custom object list\":\"T-Objects List\",\"[create] defect addition\":\"[Create] Add Bug\",\"[view] Task View\":\"[View] View Task\",\"[list] defect statistics list\":\"[List] Bug List\",\"[view] Test case view\":\"[View] View Test Case\",\"Man-hour cost\":\"Effort\",\"[list] iterative list\":\"[List] Iteration List\",\"[list] defect list\":\"[List] Bug List\",\"Defect workflow\":\"Bug Workflow\",\"Requirements workflow\":\"#Story# Workflow\",\"[create] iterative creation\":\"[Create] Create Iteration\",\"[view] defect viewing\":\"[View] View Bug\",\"[list] list of test cases\":\"[List] Test Case List\",\"[list] Custom object list\":\"[List] T-Objects List\",\"[view] release Review View\":\"[View] View Release Review\",\"[list] defect statistical report\":\"[List] Bug Report\",\"[view] demand view\":\"[View] View #Story#\",\"[list] Task list\":\"[List] Task List\",\"[list] publish review list\":\"[List] Release Review List\",\"Defect statistical report\":\"Bug Report\",\"[list] list of requirements\":\"[List] #Story# List\",\"[create] release Review creation\":\"[Create] Create Release Review\",\"[view] iterative View\":\"[View] View Iteration\",\"[create] demand creation\":\"[Create] Create #Story#\",\"List class\":\"List Class\",\"[other] man-hour cost\":\"[Others] Effort\",\"[other] workbench\":\"[Others] Workspace\",\"Online problem\":\"Online Questions\",\"[other] defect advanced query\":\"[Others] Advanced Search of Bugs\",\"[other] home page\":\"[Others] Home\",\"Edit class\":\"Edit Class\",\"[workflow] defect workflow\":\"[Workflow] Bug Workflow\",\"Workflow class\":\"Workflow Class\",\"List] defect list\":\"[List] Bug List\",\"[edit] Task Editor\":\"[Edit] Edit Task\",\"Internal test\":\"Internal Test\",\"[cross test]\":\"[Cross Test]\",\"[create] Task creation\":\"[Create] Create Task\",\"[workflow] demand workflow\":\"[Workflow] #Story# Workflow\",\"New class\":\"New Class\",\"View CLA\":\"View Class\",\"Associated Blue Shield Project\":\"Associate BK Project\",\"Your project is not related to WeChat Work robot, please follow these steps\":\"Your project is not associated with the WeCom Bot. Follow the steps below.\",\"Implementation details\":\"Execution Details\",\"[edit] requirements editing\":\"[Edit] Edit #Story#\",\"No secondary condition has been added, and only the creation operation is supported.\":\"Secondary conditions not added. Only creation is supported.\",\"Meet any condition\":\"Meet any of the conditions\",\"Perform an operation\":\"Execute Operations\",\"No historical record\":\"No history\",\"Please associate it and then create it.\":\"Associate it before creation.\",\"Instructions for the use of parameters\":\"Parameter Instructions\",\"Meet the conditions at the same time\":\"Meet all conditions\",\"Trigger event\":\"Trigger Event\",\"Your project is not associated with the Blue Shield project. Automation rules need pipeline execution data for execution.\":\"Your project is not associated with the BK project. Workflow execution data is required to execute the rule.\",\"Follow the instructions sent by the TAPD robot to associate the current TAPD project\":\"Associate the current TAPD project following the instructions sent by the TAPD bot.\",\"Executive history\":\"Execution History\",\"Select object\":\"Select Object\",\"[email title]\":\"[Email Subject]\",\"Rule information\":\"Rule Info\",\"Selection condition\":\"Select Condition\",\"Message display field\":\"Message Display Field\",\"Options are not editable\":\"Option uneditable\",\"Add execute Action\":\"Add Operation\",\"Add secondary condition\":\"Add Secondary Condition\",\"Click to open the application\":\"Click to enable the app.\",\"Automation assistant, good helper for tedious work\":\"Automation Tool is a work facilitator.\",\"Execution data\":\"Execution Data\",\"Add field\":\"Add Field\",\"The current field cannot be changed\":\"This field cannot be changed.\",\"Add condition\":\"Add Condition\",\"View all rules under the project\":\"View All Rules under the Project\",\"Note: as the parameter settings of the target project may be different, please confirm the validity of the automation rules of the target project in time after copying.\":\"Note: The parameter settings of the target project may be different. Please confirm the validity of the rule for the target project timely after copying.\",\"Instructions for the use of the function\":\"Feature Instructions\",\"Experience now\":\"Try Now\",\"Add Automation Rul\":\"Add Rule\",\"Automation Assistant details\":\"Automation Tool Details\",\"Custom preset rules\":\"Custom Preset Rules\",\"Judgment condition\":\"Verification Criteria\",\"Test the assembly line with conditions\":\"Test Conditional Pipeline\",\"Save and enable\":\"Save and Enable\",\"Edit Rul\":\"Edit Rule\",\"Three simple steps to create automated rules for the team\":\"Create the rule in just three steps.\",\"Return to the previous step\":\"Back to Previous Step\",\"On the same day\":\"Current Day\",\"View execution history\":\"View Execution History\",\"Demand status of automatic flow rotor\":\"Automatic Transition of Sub-story Status\",\"Automatic monitoring and execution\":\"Automated Monitoring Execution\",\"Automation rule does not exist or has been deleted\":\"The rule does not exist or was deleted.\",\"Learn how to use the\":\"Learn How to Use\",\"Create automated rules\":\"Create Rule\",\"Please specify the requirement category for the current workflow before performing the operation\":\"Specify #story# category for the current workflow first.\",\"After the week\":\"Week(s) Later\",\"There are no eligible demand categories\":\"No available #story# category\",\"Rule preview\":\"Rule Preview\",\"Cross-business system call\":\"Call Across Business Systems\",\"Days ago\":\" day(s) ago\",\"More scenarios and suggestions\":\"More Scenarios and Suggestions\",\"Weeks ago\":\"Week(s) Ago\",\"Months later\":\"Month(s) Later\",\"View usage documentation\":\"View User Guide\",\"Automation rules\":\"Rule\",\"Automatic flow demand status\":\"Automatic Transition of #Story# Status\",\"Welcome to process Management Assistant.\":\"Thank you for using Process Management Assistant.\",\"Months ago\":\"Month(s) Ago\",\"By automating the state flow of rules, it is supported to be used at the same time as manual flow. For more information, please see\":\"Status transitioned based on the rule can also be transitioned manually at the same time. For details, see\",\"Through automated rules, TAPD functions can be combined according to business rules, while supporting third-party service access and interaction, helping teams simplify complex processes and improve collaboration efficiency.\":\"The rule allows for combination of TAPD features based on business rules, and supports access and use of third-party services, thus helping teams streamline processes and improve collaboration efficiency.\",\"Return to the list of rules\":\"Back to Rule List\",\"Recommendation rule\":\"Recommended Rules\",\"After the execution of the assembly line is passed.\":\"After pipeline execution,\",\"To add automation rules, you need to have the permission of Automation Assistant.\":\"To add the rule, you must have access to Automation.\",\"Default template\":\"Default Template\",\"Select message @ member\":\"Select Members to @Mention\",\"Select CI service\":\"Select CI Service\",\"(View more execution objects list)\":\"(View More Execution Object Lists)\",\"Current time\":\"Current Time\",\"Check successfully\":\"Verified successfully.\",\"Iterative state\":\"Iteration Status\",\"Operation initiator\":\"Initiator\",\"Message Custom Field\":\"Custom Message Fields\",\"Enter member\":\"Enter Member\",\"Select WeChat group \\/ blackboard at work\":\"Select WeCom Group\\/Blackboard\",\"State transfer\":\"Status Transition\",\"Set message prompt\":\"Set Message\",\"Execution failed\":\"Execution failed.\",\"Iteration title\":\"Iteration Name\",\"Select execution status\":\"Select Execution Status\",\"Specify invited members\":\"Specify Members to Invite\",\"The following variables can be inserted to customize the group name.\":\"You can insert the following variables to customize group names.\",\"Select the WeChat group of enterprises\":\"Select WeCom Group\",\"Message title\":\"Message Name\",\"Select the change mode\":\"Select Method\",\"Pre-transfer state\":\"Status Before Transition\",\"The field is changed to the specified value\":\"Fixed Value\",\"Push text content by default\":\"Push Text Content by Default\",\"Message template\":\"Message Template\",\"Group name\":\"Group Name\",\"Select field\":\"Select Field\",\"Current date\":\"Current Date\",\"Message subscription\":\"Message Subscription\",\"Invite members by default\":\"Invite Members by Default\",\"After the status modification is completed, the change information will be written in the form of Issue comments.\":\"Status modified. It will be included in the change info as an issue comment.\",\"Message body\":\"Email Body\",\"Comments updated\":\"Comment updated.\",\"Comments deleted\":\"Comment deleted.\",\"Fixed value\":\"Fixed Value\",\"Deal with the change of person\":\"Owner Change\",\"Specify specific changes\":\"Specify Specific Change\",\"The status is changed to\":\"Status was changed to\",\"When the conditions are met, automatically create a group chat and invite people related to the needs to join the discussion.\":\"When the condition is met, a group chat will be created automatically and relevant story personnel will be invited to the group for discussion.\",\"Field change\":\"Field Change\",\"When the current setting condition is met, send WeChat Work text message notification to the specified demand participants\":\"When the precondition are met, a text message notification will be sent to specified story participants via WeCom.\",\"Comments have been added\":\"Comment added.\",\"Custom rule flow\":\"Custom Rule Transition\",\"Sub-demand state transfer\":\"Sub-Story Status Transition\",\"Schematic diagram\":\"Diagram\",\"Select the type of change\":\"Select Type\",\"Guidelines for automatic transfer of parent demand status\":\"Guide for Automatic Transition of Parent #Story# Status\",\"Any subtask\":\"Any Sub-Task\",\"Preview effect\":\"Preview Effect\",\"All subtasks\":\"All Sub-Tasks\",\"Any sub-requirement\":\"Any Sub-Story\",\"All sub-requirements\":\"All Sub-Stories\",\"Select Code event\":\"Select Code Event\",\"Any change is triggered\":\"Any change will trigger\",\"Circulation rule\":\"Transition Rules\",\"Quick create mode\":\"Quick Creation Mode\",\"Attachment change\":\"Attachment Change\",\"Comment on change\":\"Comment Change\",\"Select trigger action\":\"Select Trigger Operation\",\"End of execution\":\"Execution completed\",\"Select create template\":\"Select a template to create.\",\"Modify comment\":\"Modify Comment\",\"Flow according to the default rule\":\"Transition by Default Rules\",\"When created by a robot, you can fill in the values of the following fields directly in order and split the field values with spaces\":\"When creating with the bot, enter the following field values (separated with spaces) in sequence.\",\"Trigger automation rules regularly according to the following rules\":\"The rule is triggered regularly when the following rules are met.\",\"Introduction of Automation Assistant\":\"About the Automation Tool\",\"Set custom directives\":\"Set Custom Instruction\",\"Template creation mode\":\"Template Creation Mode\",\"When created, it is created according to the specified mode\":\"Create based on the specified modes.\",\"What you want to know.\":\"Questions You May Want to Know\",\"If you have any questions, please refer to\":\"For any questions, see\",\"Please select a project for the create task\":\"Select a project for the new task.\",\"When creating through a robot, it needs to be created according to the selected template. The required fields with no preset values in the template must be filled in.\":\"Create with the selected template when using the bot. Required fields without preset values in the template must be entered.\",\"Total service price\":\"Service Price\",\"Access guidelines\":\"Access Guide\",\"Please select a project for the create bug\":\"Select a project for the new bug.\",\"Please select an event\":\"Select an event.\",\"The following required fields in the current selection template have no preset values, and need to be filled in order each time you create them.\":\"No preset values are available for the following required fields in the selected template. Enter values in sequence in each creation.\",\"Third-party system name\":\"Third-Party System Name\",\"Disassociated submission\":\"Disassociation submitted.\",\"@Tapd related projects\":\"@ TAPD Associated Project\",\"No execution record\":\"No execution record\",\"Instruction has been used\":\"The instruction is in use.\",\"Dear users, how do you do?\":\"Dear users,\",\"Current remaining time\":\"Current Remaining Time\",\"Sorry, you are not a project member of the current enterprise wechat group associated project, so you cannot create it through instructions.\":\"You are not a member of the project associated with this WeCom group and unable to create using instructions.\",\"Purchase FAQ\":\"FAQs About Purchase\",\"To view all current associated projects of the group\":\"and view all the associated projects of the group.\",\"Fill in the information\":\"Enter Information\",\"Number of people purchased\":\"Number of Purchasers\",\"TAPD customer service\":\"TAPD Customer Service\",\"2 years\":\"2 years\",\"Service expiration reminder\":\"Notification of Service Expiration\",\"Please select a project for the create story\":\"Select a project for the new #story#.\",\"Functional comparison of version\":\"Edition Feature Comparison\",\"Enter1\":\"Enter\",\"Unpaid and overdue\":\"Unpaid and expired\",\"Successful application for refund\":\"Refunded\",\"Failed to create database order\":\"Failed to create the database order.\",\"You will not be able to continue to use the TAPD service if you have not purchased it when it expires\":\"Otherwise, you'll be unable to continue using the service.\",\"Followed up\":\"Followed up\",\"WeChat Work interface exception\":\"WeCom API error\",\"Version change\":\"Version Change\",\"Database payment failed to update successfully\":\"Failed to update the successful payment for database.\",\"Order already exists\":\"Order already exists.\",\"Database refund failed\":\"Database refund failed.\",\"Unpaid\":\"Unpaid\",\"Paid\":\"Paid\",\"General order\":\"Ordinary Order\",\"Failed to create pipeline execution\":\"Failed to execute the pipeline.\",\"The order has been paid\":\"Order paid\",\"Product creation failed\":\"Failed to create the product.\",\"Which methods of payment can be used?\":\"What are the supported payment methods?\",\"Invalid clue\":\"Invalid Lead\",\"Pipeline name cannot be empty\":\"Pipeline name cannot be empty.\",\"Unable to connect to the configured code repository\":\"Unable to connect to the configured code repository.\",\"Unable to connect to the Jenkins server, please check the network configuration\":\"Unable to connect to the Jenkins server. Check your network configuration.\",\"Unknown state\":\"Unknown status\",\"Can each version be tried several times?\":\"Can I trial each edition for several times?\",\"Error pulling source code\":\"Error while pulling the source code.\",\"Failed to create pipeline\":\"Failed to create the pipeline.\",\"Go to buy\":\"Purchase Now\",\"How to expand the capacity if the number of users is not enough?\":\"How can I increase user count limit?\",\"Applying for a refund\":\"Requesting refund\",\"The refund was rejected\":\"Refund request rejected\",\"Construction abort\":\"Building suspended\",\"Error data\":\"Data Error\",\"Authentication error\":\"Authentication error\",\"Edit test case\":\"Edit Test Case\",\"Comment parameter cannot be empty\":\"Comments cannot be empty.\",\"Configuration cannot be empty\":\"Configuration cannot be empty.\",\"No build permission. Enable permission for the current account in Jenkins\":\"You have no build permission. Enable it for the current account in Jenkins.\",\"There is no record of test cases for the time being.\":\"No test case record\",\"Test case setup\":\"Test Case Settings\",\"Non-grayscale items\":\"Non-Canary Released Projects\",\"Signature verification failed\":\"Failed to verify the signature.\",\"Test Plan Settings\":\"Test Plan Settings\",\"Product association disabled\":\"Product association disabled\",\"Failed to save the task\":\"Failed to save the task.\",\"Create a test plan\":\"Create Test Plan\",\"Test case execution\":\"Test Case Execution Status\",\"Not supported\":\"Unsupported\",\"Loading more\":\"Loading more...\",\"Catalog sort number\":\"Directory No.\",\"Directory name\":\"Directory Name\",\"Copy test cases\":\"Copy Test Case\",\"Expand the guide bar\":\"Expand Navigation Pane\",\"Create test cases\":\"Create Test Case\",\"Test type\":\"Test Type\",\"Catalog creator\":\"Directory Creator\",\"Remove use case\":\"Remove Case\",\"Put away the guide bar\":\"Collapse Navigation Pane\",\"Use case catalog\":\"Tcase Directory\",\"Use case type\":\"Tcase Type\",\"Illegal request\":\"Invalid request\",\"Implementation situation\":\"Execution Status\",\"Custom sort saved successfully\":\"Custom sorting order saved successfully.\",\"Directory description\":\"Directory Description\",\"Final result\":\"Final Result\",\"The person in charge of the test\":\"Test Leader\",\"Classification name\":\"Category Name\",\"The associated iteration is not editable. If you need to modify it, please recreate the test plan.\":\"Associated iterations cannot be modified. Create a test plan again before modifying the iterations.\",\"Unplanned catalog\":\"Unplanned Directory\",\"Server version\":\"Server Version\",\"Copy to the original directory\":\"Copy to Original Directory\",\"Not executed\":\"Not executed\",\"Expected result\":\"Expected Result\",\"Use case executor\":\"Case Operator\",\"Code missing project id parameter\":\"Parameter project_id is missing in some codes.\",\"Use case level\":\"Tcase Level\",\"Parent directory\":\"Parent Directory\",\"The selected use case catalog does not exist\":\"The case directory you selected does not exist.\",\"Continue to deliver\":\"Continue Delivery\",\"Date of generation\":\"Generation Date\",\"Identify whether it is an unexecuted use case\":\"Identify whether it is an unexecuted Tcase\",\"Lightweight collaborative agile research and development\":\"Lightweight Collaboration & Agile Development\",\"Automated test type\":\"Automated Test Type\",\"Branch database table ID exception\":\"Secondary database sheet ID error\",\"Show more\":\"Show More\",\"Register and log in\":\"Register & Log In\",\"The selected demand does not exist\":\"The #story# you selected does not exist.\",\"Stored procedure error report\":\"An error occurred during storage.\",\"Structural path of classification\":\"Category Structure Path\",\"Final executor\":\"Last Operator\",\"The structure of the table\":\"Sheet Structure\",\"Third-party platform\":\"Third-party Platform\",\"The person in charge of the use case\":\"Tcase Owner\",\"The pace of research and development is slow.\":\"Slow development\",\"Task-man-hour management\":\"Task & Effort Management\",\"Product manual\":\"Product Manual\",\"Personalized expansion scheme\":\"Personalized expansion solutions\",\"Quick start for beginners\":\"Getting Started\",\"Ecological cooperation\":\"Ecosystem Cooperation\",\"Use video\":\"Use Video\",\"Online support\":\"Online Support\",\"Classic case\":\"Success Stories\",\"Create a personalized solution in line with the business scenario\":\"to offer individualized solutions that fit for various business scenarios.\",\"Precipitate the essence of Tencent's ten-year agile practice, covering the whole life cycle of agile research and development to help the team achieve requirements, iterations, defects, testing, and task hours.\":\"Built on Tencent's years of experience in agile practices to cover the entire agile development lifecycle for an all-round management of development projects, including #stories#, iterations, bugs, tests, and task efforts.\",\"Tencent Cloud safety protection\":\"Tencent Cloud Security Protection\",\"Modular application\":\"Modular applications\",\"Professional R & D templates and custom fields\":\"Professional development templates and custom fields\",\"TAPD provides a variety of functional applications to support product, design, development and testing.\":\"TAPD provides a variety of features and applications to support members in different roles (product, design, development, testing, and operation).\",\"Management function, go deep into product R & D practice, and provide the professional expansion ability that the team needs most.\":\"management for stories, iterations, bugs and other applications in product development practices to give your team the most needed expansion capabilities.\",\"Tailored to the team's R & D process\":\"Tailored to your team's development process\",\"TAPD provides template configuration and custom fields for applications such as requirements, iterations, defects, etc.\":\"TAPD offers such features as template configuration and custom field\",\"Help the team to improve the efficiency of R & D\":\"helps your team greatly improve efficiency.\",\"Encrypted transmission using https\":\"HTTPS and\",\"In the face of the rapidly changing market wind, how to respond quickly to the enterprise's products is directly related to the survival of the team.\":\"The survival of a team depends on its ability to quickly respond to the rapidly changing market demands.\",\"Free registration\":\"Free Registration\",\"Comprehensive security measures to protect your information assets\":\"Multi-dimensional security mechanism to protect your information assets\",\"Collaboration and communication can be so wonderful\":\"an excellent combination that makes collaboration and communication easier than ever\",\"TAPD agile R & D solutions to solve R & D pain points and create successful products\":\"TAPD agile development solution solves your pain points and helps create successful products.\",\"Extremely fast agile R & D model\":\"Agile development approach\",\"Data security can be controlled to ensure information security in an all-round way.\":\"With data secured and controlled for highly guaranteed information security\",\"Business security monitoring\":\"Business Security Monitoring\",\"Real-time detection of business loopholes and timely disposal, put an end to high-risk hidden dangers. Strict access control, together with the enterprise's unique security IP, to ensure the security of daily use.\":\"It helps to identify and handle business vulnerabilities timely to prevent high risks. The strict access control, coupled with the unique secure IP address, ensures the security of daily operations.\",\"Through control upgrade and protocol encryption, we can keep out the security risks and ensure the uninterrupted operation of the system 7X24.\":\"Protected against security risks through control upgrade and protocol encryption to ensure continuous system operation on a 24\\/7 basis.\",\"Monitor the behavior of high-risk operations, find anomalies and warn them in real time, and at the same time take a number of emergency treatment plans, such as forced offline, locking accounts, to avoid data leakage, tampering and so on.\":\"Monitor high-risk operations, identify abnormalities in real time and give alerts, and adopt emergency plans such as forced logout and account lockout to avoid unauthorized data disclosure, tampering, etc.\",\"Server security\":\"Server Security Protection\",\"TAPD, makes collaboration more agile\":\"TAPD Makes Collaboration More Agile\",\"Open source code base and version control system to support TAPD business object association, code submission trend statistics, member contribution statistics\":\"An open-source code repository and version control system that supports the association with TAPD objects, code commit trend statistics, and member contribution statistics\",\"TLS security protocol to ensure that data access is encrypted. At the system level, limit the use of code high-risk functions to prevent security vulnerabilities from the source.\":\"TLS security protocols are used to ensure encrypted data access. High-risk functions in codes are restricted at the system level to prevent security vulnerabilities from the source.\",\"TAPD+ WeChat Work\":\"TAPD + WeCom\",\"Comprehensive safety inspection\":\"All-round Security Inspection\",\"Open source Git code hosting platform that supports TAPD business object association, code submission trend statistics, and member contribution statistics\":\"An open source Git code hosting platform, which support association with TAPD business objects, code commit trend statistics, and member contribution statistics\",\"System security measures\":\"System Security Measures\",\"Sign a cooperation agreement\":\"Cooperation Agreement Signing\",\"Partner recruitment\":\"Partner Invitation\",\"Mass innovation, mass entrepreneurship, TAPD provides free resource support for excellent teams to help the team grow.\":\"TAPD provides resources for excellent startups and teams to fuel their growth.\",\"More products\":\"More Products\",\"Research and development process tracking\":\"Development Process Tracking\",\"For enterprises engaged in strategic consulting, product training and agile training, TAPD invites you to build a cooperative ecology.\":\"TAPD welcomes companies that engage in strategy consulting, product training, and agile training.\",\"Cooperation and contact\":\"Inquiry for Cooperation\",\"Submit an application for cooperation\":\"Submit Cooperation Application\",\"Through iteration, goal setting and plan review are carried out to complete the work assignment.\":\"You can set targets, review plans, and assign tasks using Iterations,\",\"TAPD, makes it easy for teams to collaborate and communicate seamlessly.\":\"TAPD allows for easy collaboration and seamless communication within your team\",\"Efficient guarantee of product research and development\":\"For Fast Product Development\",\"Cloud document\":\"Cloud Document\",\"Application for examination and approval\":\"Request approved\",\"Ecological partner\":\"Ecosystem Partner\",\"400 hotline\":\"Hotline 400\",\"Business cooperation\":\"Business Cooperation\",\"Strict safety system\":\"Stringent Security System\",\"Resource input management\":\"Resource Investment Management\",\"TAPD has powerful defect management and statistics functions, which can record defects in an all-round way.\":\"TAPD's powerful bug management and statistics features enable you to record\",\"Solve the quality of development and follow up and repair it. At the same time, regular reports can be created by email.\":\"helps you learn about the development quality and track and fix the bugs as early as possible. You can also create and email scheduled reports\",\"And stalking. Cooperate with the defect statistical report to make a statistical analysis of BUG, which can be done in time.\":\"and track bugs in multiple dimensions. Analysis of bugs based on the statistical report\",\"Send it to project members to let team members know the quality of iterative development in time.\":\"to project members to keep them updated about the quality of iteration development.\",\"Brainstorm\":\"Brainstorming\",\"The goal is clear, the progress is controllable, the R & D process is agile and iterative, and the small steps are fast.\":\"With specific targets and controllable iteration progress, your product is developed agilely and quickly with small iterations.\",\"Request exception\":\"Request error\",\"Built for DevOps scenarios\":\"Designed for DevOps scenarios\",\"Product R & D management\":\"Product Development Management\",\"Tencent ten years agile research and development essence, tailor-made product research and development lifecycle solution\":\"Built on Tencent's years of experience in agile development, the product development lifecycle solution\",\"TAPD configuration\":\"TAPD Configuration\",\"Team transaction coordination\":\"Team Affairs Collaboration\",\"Agile practice\":\"Agile Practices\",\"From the birth of the idea to the realization of the product, make the dream possible\":\"We will help you throughout the process from conceptualization to product realization to make your dream possible.\",\"If you have any questions, you can consult by email.\":\"If you have any questions, please feel free to send us an email.\",\"TAPD lightweight collaboration solution to meet the collaboration needs of teams in different industries\":\"TAPD lightweight collaboration solution meets the collaboration needs of teams in different industries.\",\"Select document\":\"Select Document\",\"Performance management\":\"Performance Management\",\"Take a few easy steps to build a simple and easy-to-use personnel management plan to improve the efficiency of team management.\":\"Establish a concise, easy-to-use HR management solution just in several steps to improve team management efficiency\",\"The version of the browser you are using is too high to support screenshot.\":\"The version of your browser is too high. Screencapture is not supported.\",\"Too much data exceeds the limit\":\"The number of data entries exceeds the limit.\",\"Heilongjiang Province\":\"Heilongjiang\",\"Please try again later\":\"Try again later.\",\"Jilin Province\":\"Jilin\",\"Hunan\":\"Hunan\",\"Liaoning\":\"Liaoning\",\"Copied to clipboard\":\"Copied to the clipboard\",\"Help start-up teams and small organizations to collaborate in R & D to achieve a rapid transition from creativity to products\":\"It assists start-ups and small organizations in R&D collaboration to quickly convert a creative idea into a product.\",\"Informative text or illustrative text can be filled in\":\"Enter the instructional text or explanatory text.\",\"Tianjin\":\"Tianjin\",\"Overtime\":\"Timed out\",\"Anhui Province\":\"Anhui\",\"Zhejiang Province\":\"Zhejiang\",\"Guangxi\":\"Guangxi\",\"Beijing\":\"Beijing\",\"Shandong Province\":\"Shandong\",\"Inner Mongolia\":\"Inner Mongolia\",\"Enter title\":\"Enter the name.\",\"The current user does not have permissions or resources are missing\":\"The current user has no permission or the resource is lost.\",\"Parameter is not an array\":\"Parame