ers.\":\"Dashboard name cannot exceed 50 characters.\",\"Please retain at least one dashboard.\":\"Please retain at least one dashboard.\",\"Add2\":\"Added\",\"Successfully followed wiki\":\"Followed wiki successfully\",\"Hello %s,\":\"Hi %s,\",\"#length# story deleted successfully.\":\"#length# #story# deleted successfully, \",\"#length# bug deleted successfully.\":\"#length# bug deleted successfully, \",\"#length# bugs deleted in batch successfully.\":\"#length# bugs deleted in batch successfully, \",\"#length# stories deleted in batch successfully.\":\"#length# #stories# deleted in batch successfully, \",\"Create a online word\":\"Doc\",\"Create a online excel\":\"Sheet\",\"Create a online slide\":\"Slide\",\"#length# tasks deleted in batch successfully.\":\"#length# tasks deleted in batch successfully, \",\"#length# task deleted successfully.\":\"#length# task deleted successfully, \",\"Dashboard Name\":\"Name\",\"The requirement tree has reached the upper limit of #max sub story number#, and failed to create preset sub-requirements.\":\"The requirement tree has reached the upper limit of #max_sub_story_number#, and failed to create preset sub-requirements.\",\"Please enable at least one dashboard.\":\"Please enable at least one dashboard.\",\"More1\":\"More\",\"NO INCLUDED\":\"No include: #value#\",\"NO INCLUDED OF\":\"No Included of #value#\",\"Collaboration1\":\"Collaboration\",\"DevOps continuous delivery1\":\"DevOps\",\"Sales funnel1\":\"Sales<br>Funnel\",\"Weekly plan1\":\"Weekly<br>Plan\",\"Task follow-up1\":\"Task<br>Follow-up\",\"TAPD DevOps solution\":\"TAPD DevOps Solution\",\"A Git-based local code warehouse and version control system, and a universal solution for software development and code management\":\"A Git-based local code warehouse and version control system, and a universal solution for software development and code management.\",\"Allows multi-person collaborative editing and online management of project documents to support brainstorming, content sharing, and knowledge\":\"Allows multi-person collaborative editing and online management of project documents to support brainstorming, content sharing, and knowledge.\",\"A Git-based online code warehouse and version control system, and a universal solution for software development and code management\":\"A Git-based online code warehouse and version control system, and a universal solution for software development and code management.\",\"An extensible continuous integration tool to support automated building\\/test of software projects and monitor the operation of external tasks\":\"An extensible continuous integration tool to support automated building\\/test of software projects and monitor the operation of external tasks.\",\"TAPD bug management and statistical features support the evaluation of development quality, problem tracking, and bug resolution\":\"TAPD bug management and statistical features support the evaluation of development quality, problem tracking, and bug resolution.\",\"An automated OPS tool developed based on Python to provide batch system configuration, program deployment, command operation, and other\":\"An automated OPS tool developed based on Python to provide batch system configuration, program deployment, command operation, and other.\",\"Allows integration with mainstream third-party OPS tools for continuous deployment and release\":\"Allows integration with mainstream third-party OPS tools for continuous deployment and release.\",\"Enable advanced transfer rules\":\"Enable advanced transfer setting\",\"Simple and efficient team communication, visualized collaboration, and clear process feedback, help teams unleash more potentials, making work more efficient.\":\"Simple and efficient team communication, visualized collaboration, and clear process feedback, help team develop potential, making work more efficient.\",\"Covers the whole life cycle of product development, requirements planning, iteration tracking, code management, compilation and build, test management, deployment and release support.\":\"Cover the whole life cycle of product development, requirements planning, iteration tracking, code management, compilation and build, test management, deployment and release support.\",\"Support mainstream R & D tools such as Gitlab, Github, Jenkins, provide visual delivery pipeline management, and deeply integrate R & D tool chain\":\"Support mainstream R&D tools such as Gitlab, Github, Jenkins, provide visual delivery pipeline management, and deeply integrate R&D tool chain.\",\"Integration of TAPD message notification, project report and other capabilities, rapid feedback of construction results, real-time access to pipeline information\":\"Integration of TAPD message notification, project report and other capabilities, rapid feedback of construction results, real-time access to pipeline information.\",\"Record \\\"requirements-code-build-test-release\\\" lifecycle software delivery data, provide professional statistical analysis, support efficiency measurement and continuous improvement\":\"Record \\\"requirements-code-build-test-release\\\" lifecycle software delivery data, provide professional statistical analysis, support efficiency measurement and continuous improvement.\",\"Support third-party code base and version control system association, support TAPD business object association, code submission trend statistics\":\"Support third-party code base and version control system association, support TAPD business object association, code submission trend statistics.\",\"Support the integration of mainstream CI&CD tools, provide visual pipeline management, and improve product delivery efficiency\":\"Support the integration of mainstream CI&CD tools, provide visual pipeline management, and improve product delivery efficiency.\",\"Support the integration of mainstream product libraries and package management tools to help the team standardize the construction of product management\":\"Support the integration of mainstream product libraries and package management tools to help the team standardize the construction of product management.\",\"Precipitate the essence of Tencent's agile practice for more than a decade, cover the whole life cycle of agile R & D, and help the team achieve omni-directional R & D management such as requirements, iterations, defects, tasks, testing, release, etc\":\"Precipitate the essence of Tencent's agile practice for more than a decade, cover the whole life cycle of agile R&D, and help the team achieve omni-directional R&D management such as requirements, iterations, defects, tasks, testing, release, etc.\",\"The change of the tourism market is rapid, while the R & D process and mode are slow. How to adapt the R & D model to the change, TAPD helps to accomplish this arduous task along the way.\":\"The change of the tourism market is rapid, while the R&D process and mode are slow. How to adapt the R&D model to the change, TAPD helps to accomplish this arduous task along the way.\",\"Since its establishment, the R & D team has experienced a process of rapid development and expansion. How to make the team work at a uniform pace and enjoy the sellers' choice?\":\"Since its establishment, the R&D team has experienced a process of rapid development and expansion. To make the team work at a uniform pace, FXiaoKe chooses TAPD.\",\"The size of Renren excellent products team has increased from several people to more than 100 people. In order to manage conveniently and improve the efficiency of the team, Renren excellent products have been selected.\":\"The size of Renren Youpin team has increased from several people to more than 100 people. In order to manage conveniently and improve the efficiency of the team, Renren Youpin selects TAPD.\",\"During the period of rapid development, the team members expanded massively, the demand was growing, and the simple tools were difficult to meet the needs. After trying out many tools, we chose\":\"During the period of rapid development, the team members expanded massively, the demand was growing, and the simple tools were difficult to meet the needs. After trying out many tools, we chose TAPD.\",\"TAPD Tencent Agile collaboration platform specially launched the support Program for small and Micro Enterprises, which provides TAPD Enterprise Edition free service for startups and teams to help small and micro customers achieve efficient R & D collaboration.\":\"TAPD Tencent Agile collaboration platform specially launched the support Program for small and Micro Enterprises, which provides TAPD Enterprise Edition free service for startups and teams to help small and micro customers achieve efficient R&D collaboration.\",\"Customer service hotline1\":\"Support\",\"<span class=\\\"h3-en\\\">TAPD<\\/span> an agile development solution to solve your pain points and help create successful products\":\"<span class=\\\"h3-en\\\">TAPD<\\/span> is an agile development solution to solve your pain points and help create successful products\",\"TAPD supports the flexible definition of workflow according to the business, and provides professional process control and management functions to support the independent management of different business object processes to meet the needs of R & D practice.\":\"TAPD supports the flexible definition of workflows according to the business, and provides professional process control and management functions to support the independent management of different business object processes to meet the needs of R&D practice.\",\"TAPD supports the integration of mainstream collaboration and R & D management tools such as WeChat Work, Git and Jenkins, together with rich API interfaces, provides an one-stop R & D collaboration platform for enterprises, and helps the team build sustainable delivery capabilities.\":\"TAPD supports the integration of mainstream collaboration and R&D management tools such as WeChat Work, Git and Jenkins, together with rich API interfaces, provides a one-stop R&D collaboration platform for enterprises, and helps the team build sustainable delivery capabilities.\",\"TAPD Agile Story Management Solution allows quick and efficient management of stories throughout the development cycle. With the solution, you can quickly respond to market changes market changes, flexible handling of demand changes, process traceability, clarity and transparency.\":\"TAPD Agile Story Management Solution allows quick and efficient management of stories throughout the development cycle. With the solution, you can quickly respond to market changes, flexible handling of demand changes, process traceability, clarity and transparency.\",\"TAPD's powerful bug management and statistics features enable you to record and stalk in an all-round way. Statistical reports can be used to analyze BUG and track problems in time. Sending regular reports to project members can make us keep abreast of development quality.\":\"TAPD's powerful bug management and statistics features enable you to record and stalk in an all-around way. Statistical reports can be used to analyze BUG and track problems in time. Sending regular reports to project members can make us keep abreast of development quality.\",\"Can not be moved to the same workspace\":\"Can not be moved to the same workspace\",\"automation count\":\"Automation Rule Count\",\"Automation Rule\":\"Automation Rule\",\"auto task index count over limit tip\":\"The number of automation rules for this project has exceeded the limit and cannot be created.\",\"auto task index count limit warning tip\":\"The number of automation rules for this project is about to exceed the quota, and cannot be created after the quota is exceeded.\",\"auto task index count over limit tip 2\":\"The number of automation rules for this project is full.\",\"Enterprise version customers have automated assistant functions and can be used in multiple projects. The number of automated rules that 