D separated by English; number. The requirements must be the requirements under this project.\":\"Requirements ID \\\"Please fill in the requirements ID, multiple requirements ID separated by English; number. The requirements must be the requirements under this project.\",\"Associate the worker bee %s project. Add the TAPD keyword when submitting the code to associate the requirements, defects and tasks of TAPD.\":\"Associate the worker bee %s project. Add the TAPD keyword when submitting the code to associate the requirements, defects and tasks of TAPD.\",\"According to the dependency setting, the system rapid scheduling will adjust the estimated start \\/ end time of the following requirements\":\"According to the dependency setting, the system rapid scheduling will adjust the estimated start \\/ end time of the following requirements\",\"After the item is deleted, the destination data will be permanently deleted. You will not be able to retrieve any content or information you upload, add, bind or store, including, but not limited to, the project and all business objects such as requirements, defects, Kanban, documents, etc.\":\"After the item is deleted, the destination data will be permanently deleted. You will not be able to retrieve any content or information you upload, add, bind or store, including, but not limited to, the project and all business objects such as requirements, defects, Kanban, documents, etc.\",\"Step 3: enter the requirements, defects or task keywords to associate the TAPD, and display the corresponding data in the source code application when you are in the Commit code of the GIT platform\":\"Step 3: enter the requirements, defects or task keywords to associate the TAPD, and display the corresponding data in the source code application when you are in the Commit code of the GIT platform\",\"After the product is delivered and released, the product manager should pay attention to the user's feedback in time, collect the user's feedback and optimization points, and prepare for the next round of demand planning and product optimization, so as to ensure the continuous availability of the product.\":\"After the product is delivered and released, the product manager should pay attention to the user's feedback in time, collect the user's feedback and optimization points, and prepare for the next round of demand planning and product optimization, so as to ensure the continuous availability of the product.\",\"2) pull the group robot with one button, which can help you to start group chat and communicate efficiently when you encounter problems in need.\":\"2) pull the group robot with one button, which can help you to start group chat and communicate efficiently when you encounter problems in need.\",\"The checked user group defaults to inaccessible all requirements within the project. You can add user groups to the access scope settings of requirements to control the viewing scope of users' requirements.\":\"The checked user group defaults to inaccessible all stories within the project. You can add user groups to the accessible scope settings of stories to control the viewing scope of users' stories.\",\"Check the demand throughput of the selected project within a specified time frame to make it easy to understand the progress of the project.\":\"Check the demand throughput of the selected project within a specified time frame to make it easy to understand the progress of the project.\",\"TAPD agile requirements management solution, can quickly and efficiently carry on the full cycle management to the requirements. Through requirements collection, decomposition, planning and implementation, rapid response to market changes, flexible handling of requirements changes, the process is traceable, clear and more transparent\":\"TAPD agile requirements management solution, can quickly and efficiently carry on the full cycle management to the requirements. Through requirements collection, decomposition, planning and implementation, rapid response to market changes, flexible handling of requirements changes, the process is traceable, clear and more transparent\",\"Use TAPD to manage the entire R & D life cycle, use requirements to carry out product design planning, use iterative process tracking, and ensure Bug process traceability through defects. After the iterative release, timely collect user feedback to enter the research and development of the next iteration to achieve fast iteration, small steps and fast running\":\"Use TAPD to manage the entire R & D life cycle, use requirements to carry out product design planning, use iterative process tracking, and ensure Bug process traceability through defects. After the iterative release, timely collect user feedback to enter the research and development of the next iteration to achieve fast iteration, small steps and fast running\",\"Tencent, team collaboration tools, project management tools, project collaboration tools, agile development, agile project management, scrum,devops, requirements analysis, defect management, continuous integration, test cases, continuous integration, continuous delivery, Wiki, Gantt chart\":\"Tencent, team collaboration tools, project management tools, project collaboration tools, agile development, agile project management, scrum,devops, requirements analysis, defect management, continuous integration, test cases, continuous integration, continuous delivery, Wiki, Gantt chart\",\"Teams, collaboration, visualization, lightweight, customization, Kanban, reports, convenience, project, management, agility, development, taskboards, burning diagrams, storywalls, efficiency, plug-ins, workflows, wiki, defects, requirements, iterations\":\"Teams, collaboration, visualization, lightweight, customization, Kanban, reports, convenience, project, management, agility, development, taskboards, burning diagrams, #story#walls, efficiency, plug-ins, workflows, wiki, defects, requirements, iterations\",\"Requirements to be planned to iteration\":\"Requirements to be planned to iteration\",\"Belonging to demand\":\"Belonging to demand\",\"It does not belong to the demand.\":\"It does not belong to the demand.\",\"Requirements correlation task\":\"Requirements correlation task\",\"Changed for requirements and\":\"Changed for requirements and\",\"TAPD currently opens interfaces for business objects such as requirements and defects, as well as related interfaces for high-frequency operations such as relationships, historical changes, man-hour management, and so on.\":\"TAPD currently opens interfaces for business objects such as requirements and defects, as well as related interfaces for high-frequency operations such as relationships, historical changes, man-hour management, and so on.\",\"Developers can use the API API to add, delete, modify and query business objects such as requirements and defects. For more details, please see\":\"Developers can use the API API to add, delete, modify and query business objects such as requirements and defects. For more details, please see\",\"Define the status change of the product project requirement flow. Users can configure different requirements display fields for each state, and can set the effect of the state flow.\":\"Define the status change of the product project requirement flow. Users can configure different requirements display fields for each state, and can set the effect of the state flow.\",\"Saved successfully. Due to project settings, child requirements will inherit parent requirement status and some unfilled fields\":\"Saved successfully. Due to project settings, child requirements will inherit parent requirement status and some unfilled fields\",\"Due to rule restrictions, the target project of the replication requirement must have a [scheduled] status\":\"Due to rule restrictions, the target project of the replication requirement must have a [scheduled] status\",\"The current demand has been copied by Synchronize as the following target demand. Changes to the current requirements title, description, and attachments will be automatically applied to the target requirements\":\"The current demand has been copied by Synchronize as the following target demand. Changes to the current requirements title, description, and attachments will be automatically applied to the target requirements\",\"Saved successfully. Due to project settings, child requirements inherit parent requirement status and some unfilled fields\":\"Saved successfully. Due to project settings, child requirements inherit parent requirement status and some unfilled fields\",\"The newly created first task will inherit the work information of the parent requirement, and the work information of the parent requirement will be cleared\":\"The newly created first task will inherit the work information of the parent requirement, and the work information of the parent requirement will be cleared\",\"This requirement forms a Synchronize replication relationship with the following requirements, and changes in the title, description and attachment of this requirement will be updated by Synchronize to other requirements in the relationship chain.\":\"This requirement forms a Synchronize replication relationship with the following requirements, and changes in the title, description and attachment of this requirement will be updated by Synchronize to other requirements in the relationship chain.\",\"The requirement tree has reached the upper limit of 200, and failed to create preset sub-requirements.\":\"The requirement tree has reached the upper limit of 200, and failed to create preset sub-requirements.\",\"After this child requirement is created, the task information of the parent requirement will be inherited by the child requirement; if the parent requirement is planned for iteration, the parent requirement will be moved out of the iteration, please proceed with caution\":\"After this child requirement is created, the task information of the parent requirement will be inherited by the child requirement; if the parent requirement is planned for iteration, the parent requirement will be moved out of the iteration, please proceed with caution\",\"After creating this child requirement, if the parent requirement has been planned to the iteration, the parent requirement will be moved out of the iteration, please proceed with caution\":\"After creating this child requirement, if the parent requirement has been planned to the iteration, the parent requirement will be moved out of the iteration, please proceed with caution\",\"After creating this child requirement, the task information of the parent requirement will be inherited by the child requirement. Please proceed with caution.\":\"After creating this child requirement, the task information of the parent requirement will be inherited by the child requirement. Please proceed with caution.\",\"After this child requirement is created, the task information, man-hour information and cost information of the parent requirement will be inherited by the child requirement; if the parent requirement is planned for iteration, the parent requirement will be moved out of the iteration, please proceed with caution\":\"After this child requirement is created, the task information, man-hour information and cost information of the parent requirement will be inherited by the child requirement; if the parent requirement is planned for iteration, the parent requirement will be moved out of the iteration, please proceed with caution\",\"After creating this child requirement, the task information, man-hour information and cost information of the parent requirement will be inherited by this child requirement. Please proceed with caution.\":\"After creating this child requirement, the task information, man-hour information and cost information of the parent requirement will be inherited by this child requirement. Please proceed with caution.\",\"After this child requirement is created, the work and cost information of the parent requirement will be inherited by the child requirement; if the parent requirement is planned for iteration, the parent requirement will be moved out of the iteration, please proceed with caution\":\"After this child requirement is created, the work and cost information of the parent requirement will be inherited by the child requirement; if the parent requirement is planned for iteration, the parent requirement will be moved out of the iteration, please proceed with caution\",\"Requirements Backlog is a list of requirements for products to be realized, and the requirements in Backlog are sorted according to their value to users.\":\"Requirements Backlog is a list of requirements for products to be realized, and the requirements in Backlog are sorted according to their value to users.\",\"Split the requirements to the minimum granularity function acceptable to the user as sub-requirements, which are requirements that can be planned into iterations.\":\"Split the requirements to the minimum granularity function acceptable to the user as sub-requirements, which are requirements that can be planned into iterations.\",\"Iteration is the rhythm of team research and development, which is a fixed time period of Timebox,. The requirements of a release plan can plan one or more iterations. Each iteration has a product.\":\"Iteration is the rhythm of team development, it is a fixed time period Timebox, and a workitem in a release plan can be divided into multiple iterations. Each iteration will have a deliverable.\",\"Select the requirements with the highest priority from the requirements Backlog and put them into iteration. Determine the requirements scope of the iteration for each requirement assessment scale in the iteration\":\"Select the requirements with the highest priority from the requirements Backlog and put them into iteration. Determine the requirements scope of the iteration for each requirement assessment scale in the iteration\",\"Release the burnout chart to show the burnout process in which the remaining total quantity of all requirements in the release plan decreases day by day with the change of date. The more the actual combustion line (red line) fits with the baseline (green line), the healthier the release progress will be.\":\"Release the burnout chart to show the burnout process in which the remaining total quantity of all requirements in the release plan decreases day by day with the change of date. The more the actual combustion line (red line) fits with the baseline (green line), the healthier the release progress will be.\",\"One click to recalculate the parent's required man-hours\":\"One click to recalculate the parent's required man-hours\",\"If the parent id of the requirement is equal to itself, then the requirement becomes the root node\":\"If the parent_id of the requirement is equal to itself, then the requirement becomes the root node\",\"The type of message currently pushed does not support query results. If there is a need, you can contact steamed stuffed bun.\":\"The type of message currently pushed does not support query results. If there is a need, you can contact steamed stuffed bun.\",\"The query title needs to contain \\\"requirements\\\" and the severity level is \\\"urgent\\\" or high\":\"The query title needs to contain \\\"requirements\\\" and the severity level is \\\"urgent\\\" or high\",\"By extension demand\":\"By extension demand\",\"Number of requirements done\":\"Number of requirements done\",\"Waiting demand\":\"Waiting demand\",\"Demand correlation\":\"Demand correlation\",\"Task iteration follows requirement iteration\":\"Task iteration follows requirement iteration\",\"Demand update\":\"Demand update\",\"Scale of tested demand\":\"Scale of tested demand\",\"Demand creation\":\"Demand creation\",\"Any state change of the sub-requirement triggers the judgment. No separate configuration is required\":\"Any state change of the s