ate\",\"Story dependency\":\"#Story# dependency\",\"[TAPD Story] add attachments\":\"[TAPD #Story#] add attachments\",\"[TAPD Story] Story is moved\":\"[TAPD #Story#] #Story# is moved\",\"Your stories have been moved\":\"Your #stories# have been moved\",\"[TAPD Story] story Synchronize copied successfully\":\"[TAPD #Story#] #story# Synchronize copied successfully\",\"Your story Synchronize has been copied successfully.\":\"Your #story# Synchronize has been copied successfully.\",\"Your stories attachment has been updated\":\"Your #stories# attachment has been updated\",\"New story\":\"New #story#\",\"Followers need to receive Bot tips, as a demand.\":\"Followers need to receive Bot tips, as a demand.\",\"Story view\":\"#Story# view\",\"Story chart\":\"#Story# chart\",\"This Stories participants\":\"This #Stories# participants\",\"The Related Stories participants\":\"The Related #Stories# participants\",\"The Sub Stories participants\":\"The Sub #Stories# participants\",\"Subscribe for the Related Stories  Flow status message notification\":\"Subscribe for the Related #Stories#  Flow status message notification\",\"Subscribe for the Sub Stories  Flow status message notification\":\"Subscribe for the Sub #Stories#  Flow status message notification\",\"You are limited by accessibility setting of this story\\uff0ccannot visit this page.\":\"You are limited by accessibility setting of this #story#\\uff0ccannot visit this page.\",\"You are limited by accessibility setting of its #link tag# upper story#link tag end#\\uff0ccannot visit this page.\":\"You are limited by accessibility setting of its #link_tag# upper #story##link_tag_end#\\uff0ccannot visit this page.\",\"When you commit code on the Svn platform, enter the following keywords in the comments to associate with a story, bug, or task in TAPD:  |Story description:--story=[story id]--user=[usernick] |Bug description:--bug=[bug id]--user=[usernick] |Task description:--task=[task id]--user=[usernick] |Example:--story=