|eol|}Name: {|title|}{|eol|}New status: {|status|}{|eol|}{|link|}\":\"{|operator|} updated #story# status{|eol|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}Name: {|title|}{|eol|}New status: {|status|}{|eol|}{|link|}\",\"{|operator|} updated time {|time fields|} of the story's preceding object. {|eol|}{|eol|}Name: {|title|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}{|after time|}{|eol|}{|link|}\":\"{|operator|} updated time {|time_fields|} of the #story#'s preceding object. {|eol|}{|eol|}Name: {|title|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}{|after_time|}{|eol|}{|link|}\",\"{|operator|} created a story{|eol|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}Name: {|title|}{|eol|}{|link|}\":\"{|operator|} created a #story#{|eol|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}Name: {|title|}{|eol|}{|link|}\",\"Change: The \\\"preset story\\\" name was:\":\"Change: The \\\"preset #story#\\\" name was:\",\"Add: The \\\"preset story\\\" name was:\":\"Add: The \\\"preset #story#\\\" name was:\",\"Delete: The \\\"preset story\\\"\":\"Delete: The \\\"preset #story#\\\"\",\"updated the status of the story's preceding object\":\"updated the status of the #story#'s preceding object\",\"deleted a story\":\"deleted a #story#\",\"added a comment to the story and @mentioned you\":\"added a comment to the #story# and @mentioned you\",\"updated the story\":\"updated the #story#\",\"removed the dependency between the story and object {|src or dst|}\":\"removed the dependency between the #story# and object {|src_or_dst|}\",\"added a comment to story\":\"added a comment to #story#\",\"deleted the story's preceding object\":\"deleted the #story#'s preceding object\",\"changed the dependency between the story and object {|src or dst|}\":\"changed the dependency between the #story# and object {|src_or_dst|}\",\"updated the story status\":\"updated the #story# status\",\"updated the time {|time fields|} of the story's preceding object\":\"updated the time {|time_fields|} of the #story#'s preceding object\",\"created a story\":\"created a #story#\",\"Parent stories can not be assigned into a iteration.\":\"Parent #stories# can not be assigned into a iteration.\",\"All sub-stories of your story [#name#] are in the final status. Click [here|#view url#] to manage stories status.\":\"All sub-stories of your #story# [#name#] are in the final status. Click [here|#view_url#] to manage #stories# status.\",\"When you commit code on the Git platform, enter the following keywords in the comments to associate with a story, bug, or task in TAPD.\":\"When you commit code on the Git platform, enter the following keywords in the comments to associate with a #story#, bug, or task in TAPD.\",\"Story description:\":\"#Story# description:\",\"When you commit code on the Svn platform, enter the following keywords in the comments to associate with a story, bug, or task in TAPD.\":\"When you commit code on the Svn platform, enter the following keywords in the comments to associate with a #story#, bug, or task in TAPD.\",\"{|operator|} updated story. {|eol|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}Name: {|title|}{|eol|}Updated field: {|fields|}{|eol|}{|link|}\":\"{|operator|} updated #story#. {|eol|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}Name: {|title|}{|eol|}Updated field: {|fields|}{|eol|}{|link|}\",\"{|operator|} added a comment to story{|eol|}{|eol|}Title:{|title|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}Comment: {|comment|}{|eol|}{|link|}\":\"{|operator|} added a comment to #story#{|eol|}{|eol|}Title:{|title|}{|eol|}Project: {|project|}{|eol|}Comment: {|comment|}{|eol|}{|link|}\",\"Requirements and tasks that are not planned for iteration\":\"Requirements and tasks that are not planned for iteration\",\"[Bug to Story] #name#\":\"[Bug to #Story#] #name#\",\"Excessive generated stories and test cases are being imported in the backend. After the import is complete, you will receive an email notification.\":\"Excessive generated #stories# and test cases are being imported in the backend. After the import is complete, you will receive an email notification.\",\"Offers such features as template configuration and customized field management for stories, iterations, bugs and other applications in product development practices to give your team the most needed expansion capabilities\":\"Offers such features as template configuration and customized field management for #stories#, iterations, bugs and other applications in product development practices to give your team the most needed expansion capabilities\",\"Iterations Stories\":\"Iterations #Stories#\",\"The name contains a story\":\"The name contains a #story#\",\"solution covers the entire product development lifecycle (story-code-build-test-release) to help your team build and release reliable products efficiently and deliver value to users quickly.\":\"solution covers the entire product development lifecycle (story-code-build-test-release) to help your team build and release reliable products efficiently and deliver value to users quickly.\",\"Small and medium teams can use TAPD to manage the entire development lifecycle. You can design and plan stories with \\\"Stories\\\", plan and track iterations using \\\"Iterations\\\", and ensure the traceability of bug resolution using \\\"Bugs\\\". After an iteration is released, you can collect user feedback and start the development of the next iteration based on the feedback, thus making your product evolve quickly with small iterations.\":\"Small and medium teams can use TAPD to manage the entire development lifecycle. You can design and plan #stories# with \\\"Stories\\\", plan and track iterations using \\\"Iterations\\\", and ensure the traceability of bug resolution using \\\"Bugs\\\". After an iteration is released, you can collect user feedback and start the development of the next iteration based on the feedback, thus making your product evolve quickly with small iterations.\",\"The designed stories can be categorized for modular management. For a better control risk in development, a story involving complex features can be divided into multiple sub-stories and associated with them in a parent-child hierarchy. The parent-child hierarchy makes it easy to divide a story, while ensuring the centralized management of sub-stories.\":\"The designed #stories# can be categorized for modular management. For a better control risk in development, a #story# involving complex features can be divided into multiple sub-stories and associated with them in a parent-child hierarchy. The parent-child hierarchy makes it easy to divide a #story#, while ensuring the centralized management of sub-stories.\",\"When designing stories, a product manager inputs the story sheets in the Stories module. The story sheets describe in detail how the stories are implemented. Generally, the story prototypes or references are included in the story sheets as attachments.\":\"When designing #stories#, a product manager inputs the #story# sheets in the #Stories# module. The #story# sheets describe in detail how the #stories# are implemented. Generally, the #story# prototypes or references are included in the #story# sheets as attachments.\",\"The project manager creates an iteration, sets the objective as well as start and end times, and then adds the stories that need to be implemented with the iteration.\":\"The project manager creates an iteration, sets the objective as well as start and end times, and then adds the #stories# that need to be implemented with the iteration.\",\"During development, test engineers manage bugs using \\\"Bugs\\\". After the development engineers complete story development, test engineers carry out tests.\":\"During development, test engineers manage bugs using \\\"Bugs\\\". After the development engineers complete #story# development, test engineers carry out tests.\",\"Technical story \\u201cSample story title\\u201d\":\"Technical #story# \\u201cSample #story# title\\u201d\",\"(The number of stories in the story tree reaches the limit (200). Failed to create the preset sub-story.)\":\"(The number of #stories# in the #story# tree reaches the limit (200). Failed to create the preset sub-story.)\",\"The status of business story \\\"xxxx\\\" was changed from \\\"<span id=\\\"preview story old status\\\">#old status#<\\/span>\\\" to \\\"<span id=\\\"preview story new status\\\">#new status#<\\/span>\\\".\":\"The status of business #story# \\\"xxxx\\\" was changed from \\\"<span id=\\\"preview_story_old_status\\\">#old_status#<\\/span>\\\" to \\\"<span id=\\\"preview_story_new_status\\\">#new_status#<\\/span>\\\".\",\"Project Story Throughput\":\"Project #Story# Throughput\",\"Story Burn-Down Chart\":\"#Story# Burn-Down Chart\",\"Cumulative Flow Diagram of Stories\":\"Cumulative Flow Diagram of #Stories#\",\"Story Duration\":\"#Story# Duration\",\"Story Distribution\":\"#Story# Distribution\",\"There is something wrong with your phone when you are playing with it. You have a flash of inspiration and want to present it as a story. What should you do? Capture screenshots, upload to your PC, and then import them to TAPD? This is already outdated. With the TAPD Official Account, you can report bugs and stories at any time.\":\"There is something wrong with your phone when you are playing with it. You have a flash of inspiration and want to present it as a #story#. What should you do? Capture screenshots, upload to your PC, and then import them to TAPD? This is already outdated. With the TAPD Official Account, you can report bugs and #stories# at any time.\",\"On the shuttle bus, it suddenly occurred to you that a bug has not been transitioned. In the evening, you want to take a look at the stories to be discussed at tomorrow's meeting. What should you do? No need to take the trouble to seek a VPN. Just open the TAPD Official Account to view whatever you need anywhere and anytime.\":\"On the shuttle bus, it suddenly occurred to you that a bug has not been transitioned. In the evening, you want to take a look at the #stories# to be discussed at tomorrow's meeting. What should you do? No need to take the trouble to seek a VPN. Just open the TAPD Official Account to view whatever you need anywhere and anytime.\",\"If this is selected, the system automatically creates a name for the sub-story in the format: Story Name-Preset Sub-Story Name.\":\"If this is selected, the system automatically creates a name for the sub-story in the format: #Story# Name-Preset Sub-Story Name.\",\"If this is selected, the system automatically creates a name for the sub-task in the format: Story Name-Preset Task Name.\":\"If this is selected, the system automatically creates a name for the sub-task in the format: #Story# Name-Preset Task Name.\",\"After development is completed, test engineers test the stories based on the test cases in the <strong>test plan<\\/strong>.\":\"After development is completed, test engineers test the #stories# based on the test cases in the <strong>test plan<\\/strong>.\",\"TAPD provides an all-round project management tool for large and medium teams. With <strong>Stories<\\/strong> and <strong>Release Plans<\\/strong>, a team can conduct product and <strong>iteration<\\/strong> planning, and control the pace of product release, achieving agile <strong>development, testing, progress tracking<\\/strong>, and quality control. After a product is released according to the release plan, user feedback is collected and incorporated into the next product planning and development. TAPD's agile approach throughout the development lifecycle allows large and medium teams to quickly iterate products and thus develop products and manage projects as planned.\":\"TAPD provides an all-round project management tool for large and medium teams. With <strong>Stories<\\/strong> and <strong>Release Plans<\\/strong>, a team can conduct product and <strong>iteration<\\/strong> planning, and control the pace of product release, achieving agile <strong>development, testing, progress tracking<\\/strong>, and quality control. After a product is released according to the release plan, user feedback is collected and incorporated into the next product planning and development. TAPD's agile approach throughout the development lifecycle allows large and medium teams to quickly iterate products and thus develop products and manage projects as planned.\",\"During development, test engineers manage bugs using <strong>\\\"Bugs\\\"<\\/strong>. After the development engineers complete story development, test engineers carry out tests.\":\"During development, test engineers manage bugs using <strong>\\\"Bugs\\\"<\\/strong>. After the development engineers complete #story# development, test engineers carry out tests.\",\"The project manager creates an <strong>iteration<\\/strong>, sets the objective as well as start and end times, and then adds the stories that need to be implemented with the iteration.\":\"The project manager creates an <strong>iteration<\\/strong>, sets the objective as well as start and end times, and then adds the #stories# that need to be implemented with the iteration.\",\"When designing stories, a product manager inputs the <strong>story<\\/strong> sheets in the Stories module. The story sheets describe in detail how the stories are implemented. Generally, the story prototypes or references are included in the story sheets as attachments.\":\"When designing #stories#, a product manager inputs the <strong>story<\\/strong> sheets in the #Stories# module. The #story# sheets describe in detail how the #stories# are implemented. Generally, the #story# prototypes or references are included in the #story# sheets as attachments.\",\"Small and medium teams can use TAPD to manage the entire development lifecycle. You can design and plan <strong>stories<\\/strong> with \\\"Stories\\\", plan and track iterations using \\\"Iterations\\\", and ensure the traceability of bug resolution using <strong>\\\"Bugs\\\"<\\/strong>. After an iteration is released, you can collect user feedback and start the development of the next iteration based on the feedback, thus making your product evolve quickly with small iterations.\":\"Small and medium teams can use TAPD to manage the entire development lifecycle. You can design and plan <strong>stories<\\/strong> with \\\"Stories\\\", plan and track iterations using \\\"Iterations\\\", and ensure the traceability of bug resolution using <strong>\\\"Bugs\\\"<\\/strong>. After an iteration is released, you can collect user feedback and start the development of the next iteration based on the feedback, thus making your product evolve quickly with small iterations.\",\"The <strong>designed stories<\\/strong> can be categorized for modular management. For a better control risk in development, a story involving complex features can be divided into multiple sub-stories and associated with them in a parent-child hierarchy. The parent-child hierarchy makes it easy to divide a story, while ensuring the centralized management of sub-stories.\":\"The <strong>designed #stories#<\\/strong> can be categorized for modular management. For a better control risk in development, a #story# involving complex features can be divided into multiple sub-stories and associated with them in a parent-child hierarchy. The parent-child hierarchy makes it easy to divide a #story#, while ensuring the centralized management of sub-stories.\",\"A planned story can be implemented in multiple iterations. You can also use the release plan burn-down chart to keep track of the progress.\":\"A planned #story# can be implemented in multiple iterations. You can also use the release plan burn-down chart to keep track of the progress.\",\"TAPD DevOps solution covers the entire product development lifecycle (story-code-build-test-release) to help your team build and release reliable products efficiently and deliver value to users quickly.\":\"TAPD DevOps solution covers the entire product development lifecycle (story-code-build-test-release) to help your team build and release reliable products efficiently and deliver value to users quickly.\",\"The name contains a <b>story<\\/b> and (the priority is <b>Urgent<\\/b> or <b>High<\\/b>.\":\"The name contains a <b>story<\\/b> and (the priority is <b>Urgent<\\/b> or <b>High<\\/b>.\",\"<span>Invalid bugs:<\\/span> The bugs that meet all of the following conditions: (1) The creation time is within the selected time range. (2) Resolution is \\\"On hold\\\", \\\"Unable to reproduce\\\", \\\"Caused by external reasons\\\", \\\"Duplicate\\\", \\\"Depend on design\\\", \\\"Converted to story\\\", \\\"Inaccurate Description\\\", or \\\"Story changed\\\". (3) The closure time is not empty.\":\"<span>Invalid bugs:<\\/span> The bugs that meet all of the following conditions: (1) The creation time is within the selected time range. (2) Resolution is \\\"On hold\\\", \\\"Unable to reproduce\\\", \\\"Caused by external reasons\\\", \\\"Duplicate\\\", \\\"Depend on design\\\", \\\"Converted to #story#\\\", \\\"Inaccurate Description\\\", or \\\"Story changed\\\". (3) The closure time is not empty.\",\"Sample Story Name\":\"Sample #Story# Name\",\"This field does not exist in the story.\":\"This field does not exist in the #story#.\",\"Demand creator\":\"Demand creator\",\"Deals with the entire process including story collection, breakdown, planning, and implementation, to quickly respond to changes in demands and market.\":\"Deals with the entire process including #story# collection, breakdown, planning, and implementation, to quickly respond to changes in demands and market.\",\"Story Management\":\"#Story# Management\",\"<span>Iterations<\\/span><\\/span> Stories<\\/span>\":\"<span>Iterations<\\/span><\\/span> #Stories#<\\/span>\",\"The access allow list of the selected story will be overwritten and replaced, and only the following personnel will have the access. Please proceed with caution.\":\"The accessible scope of the selected #story# will be overwritten and replaced, and only the following personnel will have the access. Please proceed with caution.\",\"For the selected story, the following personnel will be added to\\/removed from the list based on the original status. Stories without a list will be only available to the following personnel. Please proceed with caution.\":\"For the selected #story#, the following personnel will be added to\\/removed from the list based on the original status. #Stories# without a list will be only available to the following personnel. Please proceed with caution.\",\"story's participants\":\"story's participants\",\"Requirement update\":\"Requirement update\",\"The project does not enable story, bug, and task objects, so there is no data to display.\":\"The project does not enable #story#, bug, and task objects, so there is no data to display.\",\"The requirement of synchronous state is transferred in the project\":\"The requirement of synchronous state is transferred in the project\",\"Add story participants to the list\":\"Add #story# participants to the list\",\"Batch delete the selected stories?\":\"Batch delete the selected #stories#?\",\"Story Point\":\"#Story# Point\",\"[TAPD story] Story is moved\":\"[TAPD #story#] #Story# is moved\",\"[TAPD story] batch allocation demand\":\"[TAPD #story#] batch allocation demand\",\"[TAPD story] attachment update\":\"[TAPD #story#] attachment update\",\"[TAPD story] story Synchronize copied successfully\":\"[TAPD #story#] #story# Synchronize copied successfully\",\"[TAPD story] New story\":\"[TAPD #story#] New #story#\",\"[TAPD story] add attachments\":\"[TAPD #story#] add attachments\",\"Requirements] requirements dependency add\":\"Requirements] requirements dependency add\",\"Requirements] requirements dependency changes\":\"Requirements] requirements dependency changes\",\"The current timing report may contain confidentiality requirements that restrict the scope of access, and the system will not do special processing for this part of the requirement. <br>Please confirm the scope of the email and proceed with caution.\":\"The current timing report may contain confidentiality requirements that restrict the scope of access, and the system will not do special processing for this part of the requirement. <br>Please confirm the scope of the email and proceed with caution.\",\"Task's release plan is decided by its parent story, cannot be edited.\":\"Task's release plan is decided by its parent #story#, cannot be edited.\",\"Already have tasks, can't adjust the estimated working hours\":\"Already have tasks, can't adjust the estimated working hours\",\"{current user} added a comment for test case [ {title} ] and mentioned you. Click to view the details.\":\"{current_user} added a comment for test case [ {title} ] and mentioned you. Click to view the details.\",\"The number of sub-stories under the parent story has exceeded #max sub story number#. Unable to generate stories.\":\"The number of sub-stories under the parent #story# has exceeded #max_sub_story_number#. Unable to generate #stories#.\",\"The number of stories in the story tree of this story has reached the limit of #max sub story number#. Unable to create the preset sub-story.\":\"The number of #stories# in the #story# tree of this #story# has reached the limit of #max_sub_story_number#. Unable to create the preset sub-story.\",\"(The number of stories in the story tree reaches the limit (#max sub story number#). Failed to create the preset sub-story.)\":\"(The number of #stories# in the #story# tree reaches the limit (#max_sub_story_number#). Failed to create the preset sub-story.)\",\"Number of demand for iteration\":\"Number of demand for iteration\",\"Demand scale point for iteration\":\"Demand scale point for iteration\",\"Story ID\":\"#Story# ID\",\"#has or have# left project and will not be saved in story accessibility setting.\":\"#has_or_have# left project and will not be saved in #story# accessibility setting.\",\"Add child requirements successfully. Due to project settings, substory requirements will inherit the parent story requirement status field and some unfilled fields.\":\"Add child requirements successfully. Due to project settings, substory requirements will inherit the parent #story# requirement status field and some unfilled fields.\",\"Stories for more than #count# sub-stories\":\"#Stories# for more than #count# sub-stories\",\"Specified story category sub-requirements\":\"Specified #story# category sub-requirements\",\"High Priority Story Completion Status\":\"High Priority #Story# Completion Status\",\"the workitem type stories selected\":\"the workitem type #stories# selected\",\"story category change success\":\"#story# category change success\",\"parent id fields cannot be empty\":\"parent_id fields cannot be empty\",\"When create #current workitem type#, Must choose #parent workitem types# as parent story\":\"When create #current_workitem_type#, Must choose #parent_workitem_types# as parent #story#\",\"Story Association Statistics\":\"#Story# Association Statistics\",\"Story Cumulative Flow Diagram\":\"#Story# Cumulative Flow Diagram\",\"Select the story state item to be counted (the residence duration of the end state is 0)\":\"Select the #story# state item to be counted (the residence duration of the end state is 0)\",\"Story Details\":\"#Story# Details\",\"When update #current workitem type#, Must choose #parent workitem types# as parent story\":\"When update #current_workitem_type#, Must choose #parent_workitem_types# as parent #story#\",\"Story with task cannot create sub-story\":\"#Story# with task cannot create sub-story\",\"Generate story\":\"Generate #story#\",\"You do not have permission to create story\":\"You do not have permission to create #story#\",\"Topic title generates story title, remarks and links generate detailed description of story, ICONS are not generated; parent story needs to generate less than 200.\":\"Topic title generates #story# title, remarks and links generate detailed description of #story#, ICONS are not generated; parent #story# needs to generate less than 200.\",\"Checked stories will be deleted, along with #element# child stories and associated tasks. Are you sure to delete?\":\"Checked #stories# will be deleted, along with #element# child #stories# and associated tasks. Are you sure to delete?\",\"Checked stories will be deleted, along with #element# #relateNames#. Are you sure to delete?\":\"Checked #stories# will be deleted, along with #element# #relateNames#. Are you sure to delete?\",\"What story categories use this status\":\"What #story# categories use this status\",\"#num# confidential stories have been hidden\":\"#num# confidential #stories# have been hidden\",\"Workitem type of execution\":\"Workitem type of execution\",\"The iteration is locked,increasing\\/decreasing demand within this iteration is not supported\":\"The iteration is locked,increasing\\/decreasing demand within this iteration is not supported\",\"#current workitem type#, Must choose #parent workitem types# as parent story\":\"#current_workitem_type#, Must choose #parent_workitem_types# as parent #story#\",\"sub-stories, associated tasks and dependencies\":\"sub-stories, associated tasks and dependencies\",\"The checked stories will be deleted, as well as #element# their #relateNames#. Are you sure to delete them?\":\"The checked #stories# will be deleted, as well as #element# their #relateNames#. Are you sure to delete them?\",\"sub-stories' title will be used as\":\"sub-stories' title will be used as\",\"This story is confidential and has no authority to view.\":\"This #story# is confidential and has no authority to view.\",\"When a branch is created under the requirement, the requirement status flows to \\\"being implemented\\\"\":\"When a branch is created under the requirement, the requirement status flows to \\\"being implemented\\\"\",\"When the commit information contains customized keywords, the requirements flow to \\\"implemented\\\"\":\"When the commit information contains customized keywords, the requirements flow to \\\"implemented\\\"\",\"After the merger request is passed, the requirements flow to \\\"to be tested\\\"\":\"After the merger request is passed, the requirements flow to \\\"to be tested\\\"\",\"[TAPD stories] Bulk edit succeeded\":\"[TAPD #stories#] Bulk edit succeeded\",\"Stories edited in batches #num# item(s)\":\"#Stories# edited in batches #num# item(s)\",\"These stories attribute \\u201c#attr#\\u201c have been bulk edit  to \\u201c#value#\\u201d by #operator#\":\"These #stories# attribute \\u201c#attr#\\u201c have been bulk edit  to \\u201c#value#\\u201d by #operator#\",\"[TAPD stories] Bulk edit failed\":\"[TAPD #stories#] Bulk edit failed\",\"There is 1 story failed because of iteration lock.\":\"There is 1 #story# failed because of iteration lock.\",\"There are #d# stories failed because of iteration lock.\":\"There are #d# #stories# failed because of iteration lock.\",\"Trigger story\":\"Trigger #story#\",\"Trigger story parents\":\"Trigger #story# parents\",\"Specified story\":\"Specified #story#\",\"Will be created under the selected story\":\"Will be created under the selected #story#\",\"Specified story title\":\"Specified #story# title\",\"Please enter the story title or ID to search for the parent story\":\"Please enter the #story# title or ID to search for the parent #story#\",\"The following variables can be inserted to customize the story title.\":\"The following variables can be inserted to customize the #story# title.\",\"No story category permission\":\"No #story# category permission\",\"When enabled, Git will display on story\\/bug\\/task tab page.\":\"When enabled, Git will display on #story#\\/bug\\/task tab page.\",\"Through the quick configuration, create\\/associate Git branches with requirements\\/defect flow state via quick configuration, more complex scenarios through the autotask assistant configuration.\":\"Through the quick configuration, create\\/associ