 deleted.\",\"Input new graph name\":\"Enter the new chart's name.\",\"Public\":\"Public\",\"you have no permission\":\"You have no permission.\",\"Private Setting\":\"Privacy\",\"No permission\":\"You have no permission.\",\"\\u7a7a\":\"empty\"},\"mini project\":{\"t name\":\"Light Collaboration Space\",\"Activities\":\"activities\",\"Applications integration\":\"Application Integration\",\"#nick# has a total of #length# to be planned\":\"#nick# has a total of #length# to be planned\",\"A maximum of #count# attachments can be uploaded\":\"A maximum of #count# attachments can be uploaded\",\"t short name\":\"Space\",\"Keep group\":\"Keep group\",\"Do not use template\":\"Do not use template\",\"#tName# manage\":\"Manage #tName#\",\"Batch operation failed due to some workitems not complying with the rules.\":\"Batch operation failed due to some workitems not complying with the rules.\",\"Move to group\":\"Move to Group\",\"Tgit Branch\":\"Tgit Branch\",\"Are you sure to remove member #memberName#? After removal, He will not be able to access this space.\":\"Are you sure to remove member #memberName#? After removal, He will not be able to access this space.\",\"Are you sure to exit the \\u3010#projectName#\\u3011 space? After you leave, you need to be invited to join again.\":\"Exit the space \\\"#projectName#\\\"? After you leave, you need to be invited to join again.\",\"Close Space\":\"Close Space\",\"Exit Space\":\"Exit Space\",\"Successfully closed\":\"Successfully closed\",\"Workitem Export\":\"\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u9879\\u5bfc\\u51fa\",\"Creator\":\"Creator\",\"\\u8fdb\\u5ea6\\u963b\\u585e\":\"Progress blocked\",\"\\u6709\\u98ce\\u9669\":\"Risky\",\"\\u5f85\\u8fdb\\u4e00\\u6b65\\u8ba8\\u8bba\":\"To be disscussed\",\"P0\\uff1a\\u9ad8\\u4f18\":\"P0:High priority\",\"P1\\uff1a\\u4e2d\\u4f18\":\"P1:Medium priority\",\"P2\\uff1a\\u4f4e\\u4f18\":\"P2:Low priority\",\"P3\\uff1a\\u6682\\u7f13\":\"P3:Nice to have\",\"open\":\"Uncompleted\",\"done\":\"Completed\",\"Associate Content\":\"Associate content\",\"Message notify\":\"Message Notification Settings\",\"Field update\":\"Field Update\",\"Receive role\":\"Recipient Role\",\"Prompt\":\"Notification\",\"Data will not be deleted after closed, you are reopen later.\":\"After you close the space, the data will not be deleted. You can reopen the space again.\",\"No template found?\":\"Didn't find the template you want?\",\"Immediate feedback\":\"Share Feedback\",\"\\u529f\\u80fd\\u8d70\\u67e5\":\"Feature Checking\",\"\\u4efb\\u52a1\\u8ddf\\u8fdb\":\"Task Follow-up\",\"\\u53cd\\u9988\\u8ddf\\u8e2a\":\"Feedback Tracking\",\"\\u5468\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Weekly Plan Management\",\"\\u56de\\u987e\\u4f1a\\u8bae\":\"Retrospective Meetings\",\"\\u5408\\u540c\\u8ba2\\u5355\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Contract & Order Management\",\"\\u8fd0\\u8425\\u521b\\u4f5c\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Operations & Creations Management\",\"\\u5e2e\\u52a9\\u4f60\\u7684\\u56e2\\u961f\\u4fbf\\u6377\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u8d70\\u67e5\\u95ee\\u9898\\uff0c\\u5e76\\u8f7b\\u677e\\u8ddf\\u8fdb\\u4fee\\u590d\\u3001\\u9a8c\\u8bc1\\u60c5\\u51b5\\u3002\\u6a21\\u677f\\u914d\\u5907\\u4e86\\u6d88\\u606f\\u901a\\u77e5\\uff0c\\u8f85\\u52a9\\u4ea7\\u54c1 \\/ \\u8bbe\\u8ba1 \\/ \\u7814\\u53d1 \\/ \\u6d4b\\u8bd5\\u9ad8\\u6548\\u534f\\u4f5c\\u3002\":\"Keep track of issues when checking features, follow up with bug fixes, and verify the status. This template helps product, design, R&D, and test departments collaborate efficiently.\",\"\\u8f7b\\u677e\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u5e76\\u7ba1\\u7406 \\u56e2\\u961f \\/ \\u4e2a\\u4eba \\u5f85\\u529e\\u4efb\\u52a1\\uff0c\\u9002\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u4efb\\u52a1\\u8ddf\\u8fdb\\u3001\\u5468\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u5236\\u5b9a\\u3001\\u6668\\u4f1a\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u7b49\\u573a\\u666f\\u3002\":\"Plan and manage your or your team's tasks to be done. This template helps you track tasks, set weekly plans, and record morning meetings.\",\"\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u4e0e\\u8ddf\\u8fdb\\u7528\\u6237\\u53cd\\u9988\\u4e8b\\u9879\\uff0c\\u5236\\u5b9a\\u8ddf\\u8fdb\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u3002\":\"Record user feedback and formulate follow-up plans.\",\"\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u6bcf\\u5468\\u56e2\\u961f\\u6210\\u5458\\u7684\\u6bcf\\u5468\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u8ba1\\u5212\\uff0c\\u8ddf\\u8fdb\\u5b8c\\u6210\\u60c5\\u51b5\\u3002\":\"Manage the weekly work plans of each team member and follow up on the completion status.\",\"\\u56de\\u987e\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u9636\\u6bb5\\u5185\\u56e2\\u961f\\u6210\\u5458\\u5bf9\\u4e8e\\u56e2\\u961f\\u534f\\u4f5c\\u7684\\u95ee\\u9898\\u4e0e\\u5efa\\u8bae\\uff0c\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u6539\\u8fdb\\u9879\\uff0c\\u589e\\u5f3a\\u56e2\\u961f\\u7684\\u4fe1\\u4efb\\u611f\\u4e0e\\u51dd\\u805a\\u529b\\u3002\":\"Review issues and suggestions raised by team members on team collaboration during a period to enhance the team's sense of responsibility and cohesion.\",\"\\u5e2e\\u52a9\\u91c7\\u8d2d\\u6216\\u5546\\u52a1\\u540c\\u5b66\\u5bf9\\u5408\\u540c\\u8ba2\\u5355\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u4f9b\\u5e94\\u5546\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u7ba1\\u7406\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u5236\\u5b9a\\u5408\\u540c\\u7eed\\u671f\\u63d0\\u9192\\u3002\":\"Purchasing or business departments can use this template to manage contracts, orders, and suppliers, and set reminders for contract renewal.\",\"\\u8fd0\\u8425\\u56e2\\u961f\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u8f7b\\u677e\\u7684\\u521b\\u5efa\\u8fd0\\u8425\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u3001\\u89c4\\u5212\\u8fd0\\u8425\\u6d3b\\u52a8\\u6240\\u9700\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u7684\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u9879\\uff0c\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u8fd0\\u8425\\u7269\\u6599\\u5236\\u4f5c\\u9884\\u7b97\\u3001\\u7d20\\u6750\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u7b49\\u3002\":\"Operations teams can use this template to create operational plans, plan workitems for operational activities, record the production budget for operational materials, and manage materials.\",\"I want feedback\":\"My Feedback\",\"Describe your problems & suggestions and work together to create a better experience\":\"Share any issues that you are facing or suggestions to help us create a better experience\",\"Add workitem\":\"Add Workitem\",\"Table\":\"List\",\"Document\":\"Files\",\"Add group\":\"Add Group\",\"Progress manual\":\"Progress\",\"Create field name\":\"Field name\",\"Please input field name\":\"Enter a field name\",\"Create a WeCom group chat of current space, and invite #member count# members to have a discussion. Newly added members will also automatically join the group!\":\"Create a WeCom group chat for the current space and invite #member count# members to have a discussion. Newly added members will also automatically join the group!\",\"spatial dynamics\":\"Space Activities\",\"Shortcut Key\":\"Shortcut Keys\",\"archive management\":\"Archive Management\",\"R & D collaboration\":\"R&D collaboration\",\"Can't find the desired application?\":\"Didn't find the application you want?\",\"Filing time\":\"Archive Time\",\"\\u6807\\u9898\":\"Name\",\"\\u7c7b\\u522b\":\"Category\",\"\\u64cd\\u4f5c\":\"Operation\",\"Archive notice\":\"Archive Notification\",\"#count# workitems will be archived, #openCount# on open status, are you sure to archive?\":\"#count# workitems will be archived,  included #openCount# open workitem. Continue?\",\"Are you sure to delete this group? Can not recover after delete\":\"Delete this group? Deleted groups cannot be recovered.\",\"Delete all workitems(and sub workitems) under group\":\"Delete all workitems (and sub workitems) under group\",\"Add a row up\":\"Insert Row Above\",\"Add a row down\":\"Insert Row Below\",\"Copy Title and Link\":\"Copy Name and Link\",\"Create new field\":\"Create Field\",\"\\u5f85\\u529eToDo\":\"ToDo\",\"\\u8f7b\\u677e\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u5e76\\u7ba1\\u7406 \\u56e2\\u961f \\/ \\u4e2a\\u4eba \\u5f85\\u529e\\u4efb\\u52a1\\uff0c\\u9002\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u4efb\\u52a1\\u8ddf\\u8fdb\\u3001\\u56e2\\u961f\\u534f\\u4f5c\\u3001\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u5236\\u5b9a\\u7b49\\u573a\\u666f\\u3002\":\"Easily plan and manage team\\/personal to-do tasks, suitable for task follow-up, team collaboration, plan formulation and other scenarios.\",\"\\u7528\\u6237\\u53cd\\u9988\\u8ddf\\u8e2a\":\"User Feedback Tracking\",\"SWOT\\u5206\\u6790\":\"SWOT Analysis\",\"SWOT\\u5206\\u6790\\u662f\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u7efc\\u5408\\u5185\\u5916\\u56e0\\u7d20\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u7cfb\\u7edf\\u8bc4\\u4ef7\\u3001\\u4ece\\u800c\\u9009\\u62e9\\u6700\\u4f73\\u6218\\u7565\\u7684\\u65b9\\u6cd5\\u3002\\u672c\\u6a21\\u677f\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5e2e\\u52a9\\u4f60\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u5168\\u9762\\u3001\\u7cfb\\u7edf\\u7684\\u5206\\u6790\\uff0c\\u4ece\\u800c\\u5236\\u5b9a\\u66f4\\u5408\\u9002\\u7684\\u53d1\\u5c55\\u6218\\u7565\\u3001\\u8ba1\\u5212\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u5bf9\\u7b56\\u7b49\\u3002\":\"SWOT Analysis is a method for systematically evaluating internal and external factors to select the best strategy. This template can help you conduct comprehensive and systematic analysis, so as to formulate more appropriate development strategies, plans, and countermeasures.\",\"OKR\\u8ba1\\u5212\":\"OKR Plan\",\"\\u9002\\u5408\\u516c\\u53f8\\u3001\\u56e2\\u961f\\u3001\\u4e2a\\u4eba\\u7684OKR\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u3002\":\"Suitable for OKR management of companies, teams, and individuals.\",\"\\u5c06\\u4e1a\\u52a1\\u5b9e\\u73b0\\u8def\\u5f84\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u7cfb\\u7edf\\u5316\\u5730\\u62c6\\u89e3\\uff0c\\u4ee5\\u5b9e\\u73b0\\u4e1a\\u52a1\\u76ee\\u6807\\u3002\":\"Systematically disassemble the business realization path to achieve business goals.\",\"\\u7ade\\u54c1\\u5206\\u6790\":\"Competitive Analysis\",\"\\u5bf9\\u7ade\\u54c1\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u591a\\u4e2a\\u7ef4\\u5ea6\\u7684\\u62c6\\u89e3\\u3001\\u5206\\u6790\\u3002\":\"Disassemble and analyze competing products in multiple dimensions.\",\"\\u5ba2\\u670d\\u5de5\\u5355\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Customer Service Ticket Management\",\"\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u8bb0\\u5f55\\u5de5\\u5355\\u6ee1\\u610f\\u5ea6\\u3001\\u8f6c\\u5355\\u7387\\u3001\\u54cd\\u5e94\\u65f6\\u957f\\u7b49\\u60c5\\u51b5\\uff0c\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u5206\\u6790\\u5ba2\\u670d\\u8d28\\u91cf\\u3002\":\"It is used to record work order satisfaction, conversion rate, response time, etc., and to analyze customer service quality.\",\"\\u6e38\\u620f\\u89d2\\u8272\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Game Character Management\",\"\\u53ef\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u6e38\\u620f\\u89d2\\u8272\\u7ba1\\u7406\\uff0c\\u53ef\\u89c6\\u5316\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u7f8e\\u672f\\u5206\\u5de5\\u3001\\u89d2\\u8272\\u5c5e\\u6027\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\\u3001\\u89d2\\u8272\\u7248\\u672c\\u5b89\\u6392\\u7b49\\u4e8b\\u9879\\uff0c\\u9ad8\\u6548\\u534f\\u4f5c\\u3002\":\"It can be used for game role management, visual management of art division of labor, role attribute design, role version arrangement, etc., for efficient collaboration.\",\"\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Design Management\",\"\\u8f85\\u52a9\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\\u56e2\\u961f\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u5404\\u6765\\u6e90\\u7684\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\\u9700\\u6c42\\uff0c\\u5e76\\u53ef\\u8fdb\\u884c\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u5206\\u914d\\u3001\\u56e2\\u961f\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u3001\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\\u8d44\\u4ea7\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u3002\":\"Assist the design team to manage design requirements from various sources, and perform work distribution, team management, and design asset management.\",\"\\u5f00\\u6e90\\u9879\\u76ee\\u534f\\u4f5c\":\"Open Source Project Collaboration\",\"\\u534f\\u52a9\\u9879\\u76ee\\u56e2\\u961f\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u4e1a\\u52a1\\u9700\\u6c42\\u3001\\u56e2\\u961f\\u5efa\\u8bbe\\u3001\\u54c1\\u724c\\u8fd0\\u8425\\u7b49\\u534f\\u4f5c\\u4e8b\\u9879\\u3002\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u8ba9\\u6210\\u5458\\u80fd\\u591f\\u5173\\u6ce8\\u5230\\u9879\\u76ee\\u5168\\u90e8\\u7684\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\uff0c\\u4f7f\\u9879\\u76ee\\u5404\\u7c7b\\u4e8b\\u9879\\u7684\\u534f\\u4f5c\\u66f4\\u52a0\\u6e05\\u6670\\u9ad8\\u6548\\u3002\":\"Assist the project team to manage business requirements, team building, brand operation and other collaborative matters. It allows members to pay attention to all the work of the project, making the collaboration of various items of the project clearer and more efficient.\",\"\\u8fd0\\u7ef4\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Operation and Maintenance Management\",\"\\u53ef\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u8fd0\\u7ef4\\u4e8b\\u9879\\u7ba1\\u7406\\uff0c\\u5c06\\u7ebf\\u4e0a\\/\\u7ebf\\u4e0b\\u5404\\u7c7b\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u7edf\\u4e00\\u8ddf\\u8fdb\\u3002\":\"It can be used for management of operation and maintenance items, and can follow up all kinds of online\\/offline work in a unified manner.\",\"\\u5ba2\\u6237\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Customer Management\",\"\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u7cbe\\u7b80\\u7684\\u5ba2\\u6237\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u540e\\u53f0\\u3002\":\"A streamlined customer management background.\",\"\\u5546\\u673a\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Business Opportunity Management\",\"\\u7528\\u4e8e\\u8ddf\\u8e2a\\u6bcf\\u4e2a\\u9636\\u6bb5\\u7684\\u5546\\u673a\\u60c5\\u51b5\\uff0c\\u5e2e\\u52a9\\u9ad8\\u6548\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u9500\\u552e\\u5168\\u6d41\\u7a0b\\u3002\":\"It is used to track business opportunities at each stage and help manage the entire sales process efficiently.\",\"\\u62db\\u8058\\u4eba\\u624d\\u6c60\":\"Recruitment Talent Pool\",\"\\u7ba1\\u7406\\u62db\\u8058\\u4eba\\u624d\\u5019\\u9009\\u6c60\\uff0c\\u8ddf\\u8e2a\\u62db\\u8058\\u6d41\\u7a0b\\u8fdb\\u5ea6\\u3002\":\"Manage your recruiting candidate pool and track the progress of the hiring process.\",\"\\u6d41\\u7a0b\\u6307\\u5357\":\"Process Guide\",\"\\u5e2e\\u52a9\\u56e2\\u961f\\u6807\\u51c6\\u5316\\u5de5\\u4f5c\\u6d41\\u7a0b\\uff0c\\u68b3\\u7406\\u4e00\\u4efd\\u6e05\\u6670\\u8be6\\u7ec6\\u7684\\u6307\\u5357\\u3002\":\"Help the team standardize the workflow and organize a clear and detailed guide.\",\"\\u901a\\u7528\":\"General\",\"\\u76ee\\u6807\\u89c4\\u5212\":\"Goal Planning\",\"\\u4ea7\\u54c1\\u8bbe\\u8ba1\":\"Product Design\",\"\\u7814\\u53d1\\u8fd0\\u7ef4\":\"R&D Operation and Maintenance\",\"\\u5e02\\u573a\\u8fd0\\u8425\":\"Market Operation\",\"\\u9500\\u552e\\u7ba1\\u7406\":\"Sales Management\",\"\\u4eba\\u4e8b\\u884c\\u653f\":\"Personnel Administration\",\"more equal\":\"Greater Than or Equal To (\\u2265)\",\"less equal\":\"Less Than or Equal To (\\u2264)\",\"To Story\":\"To #Story#\",\"Story(<a href=\\\"#link#\\\" target=\\\" blank\\\">Link<\\/a>)\":\"Story(<a href=\\\"#link#\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Link<\\/a>)\",\"Story\":\"#Story#\",\"Historical trends are only kept until September 1, 2022. If there is a need for extension, you can\":\"Historical trends are only kept until September 1, 2022. If there is a need for extension, you can\",\"Historical trends are only kept until September 1, 2022. If there is a need for extension, you can feedback\":\"Historical trends are only kept until September 1, 2022. If there is a need for extension, you can feedback\",\"Story:#name#\":\"Story:#name#\",\"associated a story\":\"associated a #story#\",\"disassociated a story\":\"disassociated a #story#\",\"unarchived a sub workitem\":\"unarchived a sub workitem\"},\"modules\":{\"Copy Components Config to\":\"Copy module configuration to\"},\"my dashboard\":{\"my todo\":\"To-Do\",\"efficiency\":\"Efficiency\",\"widget not found\":\"No relevant component\",\"progress\":\"Progress\",\"other\":\"Others\",\"task\":\"Task\",\"bug\":\"Bug\",\"effort\":\"Effort\",\"quality\":\"Quality\",\"belong project\":\"Project\",\"team\":\"Team\",\"story\":\"#Stories#\",\"cross project\":\"Cross-Project\",\"module not found\":\"No relevant module\",\"card title\":\"Card Name\",\"all\":\"All\",\"report form name\":\"Report Name\",\"bug distribution\":\"Bug Distribution Chart\",\"chart\":\"Chart\",\"bug trend\":\"Bug Trend Chart\",\"Quickly view the recent operation dynamics in the project, including creation, editing, deletion, etc\":\"A quick view of your recent operations in projects, such as creation, edits, and deletion.\",\"Demand burning diagram for ongoing iterations\":\"The burn-down chart of #stories# for an in-process iteration to predict the work progress\",\"my feed card\":\"Activities Card\",\"team todo\":\"Team To-Dos Statistics\",\"story distribution\":\"#Story# Distribution Chart\",\"project chart\":\"Project Chart\",\"chart type card\":\"Graphic Card\",\"table type card\":\"Tabular Card\",\"story time\":\"#Story# Duration in Status\",\"bug o