ry belongs to an iteration.\":\"A #story# will be recovered to an independent #story# if its original parent #story# has been added to an iteration.\",\"Tasks will be recovered to root if their target story is unavailable.\":\"A task will be recovered to an independent task if its original associated #story# no longer exists.\",\"Recover %s\":\"Recover %s\",\"Tasks will be recovered to root if there is a story under their target story.\":\"A task will be recovered to an independent task if its original associated #story# has sub-stories.\",\"Stories will be recovered to root if their target story is a secret story.\":\"A #story# will be recovered to an independent #story# if its original parent #story# is a private one.\",\"Stories will be recovered to root if there is a task under their target story.\":\"A #story# will be recovered to an independent #story# if its original parent #story# has tasks.\",\"Data will be kept for 90 days since deleting.\":\"Only data for the last 90 days can be recovered.\",\"or recover it from <a target=' blank' href='#href#'>recycle bin<\\/a>\":\" or recover it from<a target='_blank' href='#href#'>recycle bin<\\/a>\",\"Stories will be recovered to root if the size of their target tree reaches 200 after recovery.\":\"#Stories# will be recovered to root if the size of their target tree reaches 200 after recovery.\",\"Stories will be recovered to root if the size of their target tree reaches #max sub story number# after recovery.\":\"#Stories# will be recovered to root if the size of their target tree reaches #max_sub_story_number# after recovery.\"},\"recyclebin\":{\"title\":\"Name\",\"name\":\"Name\",\"id\":\"ID\",\"b board id\":\"Board\\/Session\",\"created\":\"Creation Time\",\"deleted\":\"Deletion Time\",\"tcase\":\"Test Cases\",\"creator\":\"Creator\",\"task\":\"Task\",\"bug\":\"Bug\",\"story\":\"#Story#\",\"operation user\":\"Deleted By\",\"reporter\":\"Creator\",\"modified\":\"Deletion Time\",\"deleter\":\"Deleted By\",\"modifier\