m fields will be overlay the target's, then templates and workflow will be copied to the target workspace.\":\"The bug attributes and custom fields in the target project will be overwritten, and new templates and workflows will be added and enabled by default. This operation may affect the historical bugs of the target project.\",\"Bug properties, templates and workflow will be copied to the target or overlay the target's.\":\"The bug attributes and workflows will be copied to the target project.\",\"Mail content\":\"Email Content\",\"Click to edit title\":\"Click to Edit Name\",\"Story properties and custom fields will be overlay the target's, then templates and workflow will be copied to the target workspace.\":\"The #story# attributes and custom fields in the target project will be overwritten, and new templates and workflows will be added and enabled by default. This operation may affect the historical #stories# of the target project.\",\"Copying to the old project may result in historical data field dislocation, etc., please operate carefully,This operation is irreversible, if in doubt,Please contact tapd customer service\":\"Copying to the old project may cause the historical data fields to be misplaced. This operation cannot be undone. Please proceed with caution. If you have any questions, contact TAPD Customer Service.\",\"Story properties, templates and workflow will be copied to the target or overlay the target's.\":\"The #story# attributes and workflows will be copied to the target project.\",\"Copying to the old project may result in historical data field dislocation, etc., please operate carefully,This operation is irreversible, if in doubt,Please consult the 5001 hotline first\":\"Copying to the old project may cause historical data fields to be misplaced. This operation cannot be undone. Please proceed with caution. If you have any questions, call 5001 hotline.\",\"Recent Visited\":\"Recently Accessed\",\"Copy report template to the selected products