ces for efficient R&D collaboration, the essence of Tencent's team collaboration philosophy and agile R&D.\":\"Best practices for efficient R&D collaboration, the essence of Tencent's team collaboration philosophy and agile R&D.\",\"TAPD is an agile product R&D collaboration platform originating from Tencent, providing one-stop service throughout the agile development lifecycle. It covers the entire product R&D process, from product concept formation, product planning, requirement analysis, project planning and tracking, quality testing, to build release, and user feedback tracking. It provides flexible customizable applications and powerful integration capabilities, helping R&D teams effectively manage requirements, resources, progress, and quality, standardize and improve the product R&D process, and improve R&D efficiency and product quality. \":\"TAPD is an agile product R&D collaboration platform originating from Tencent, providing one-stop service throughout the agile development lifecycle. It covers the entire product R&D process, from product concept formation, product planning, requirement analysis, project planning and tracking, quality testing, to build release, and user feedback tracking. It provides flexible customizable applications and powerful integration capabilities, helping R&D teams effectively manage requirements, resources, progress, and quality, standardize and improve the product R&D process, and improve R&D efficiency and product quality. \",\"Covering the entire life cycle of business, product, design, development, testing, and release.\":\"Covering the entire life cycle of business, product, design, development, testing, and release.\",\"Gantt chart displays project progress, task relationships, and resource allocation, to better understand the project situation and make reasonable decisions. Task boards clearly show the follow-up status of each task, tracking the progress of each person in real time.\":\"Gantt chart displays project progress, task relationships, and resource allocation, to better understand the project situation and make reasonable decisions. Task boards clearly show the follow-up status of each task, tracking the progress of each person in real time.\",\"Performing labor hour estimates on split work items, and clearly controlling labor costs through labor hour reports.\":\"Performing labor hour estimates on split work items, and clearly controlling labor costs through labor hour reports.\",\"Supporting \\\"trigger conditions + execution actions\\\" for orchestration and execution, helping users deal with cumbersome processes.\":\"Supporting \\\"trigger conditions + execution actions\\\" for orchestration and execution, helping users deal with cumbersome processes.\",\"Go to TAPD home page\":\"Go to TAPD home page\",\"The same type of R&D management tool\":\"The same type of R&D management tool\"},\"service integration\":{\"CONFLUENCE BRIEF INTRODUCTION\":\"Import data from Confluence to TAPD Wiki.\",\"CONFLUENCE DESCRIPTION\":\"This service helps you import pages in a Confluence space into wikis in a TAPD workspace.\",\"JIRA BRIEF INTRODUCTION\":\"Import data from Jira to TAPD Workspace.\",\"JIRA DESCRIPTION\":\"This service helps you import Jira workspaces into TAPD workspaces.\",\"JIRA IMPORT TITLE\":\"Import Data from Jira\",\"CONFLUENCE IMPORT TITLE\":\"Import Data from Confluence\",\"Parsing uploaded file(s)...\":\"Parsing uploaded file(s)...\",\"Parsing...\":\"Parsing...\",\"Failed to import.\":\"Failed to import.\",\"Import successed partially.\":\"Import successed partially.\",\"Import successed completely.\":\"Import successed completely.\",\"Import successed completely, would you like install it to company?\":\"Import successed completely, would you like install it to company?\",\"After submitting the code, you can associate the requirements, defects, tasks of TAPD with the corresponding keywords, and you can also transfer the status of the requirements (such as configuring automation rules)\":\"After submitting the code, you can associate the requirements, defects, tasks of TAPD with the corresponding keywords, and you can also transfer the status of the requirements (such as configuring automation rules)\"},\"setting\":{\"submit\":\"Submit\",\"UI Enginneer\":\"UI Personnel\",\"save selected step as first step\":\"Set the selected step to the first step\",\"config steps\":\"Configure Step Info\",\"Add Step\":\"Add Step\",\"Project Manager\":\"Project Manager\",\"set selected workflow as default\":\"Set the selected workflow to default\",\"workflow Setting\":\"Workflow Configuration\",\"Test Engineer\":\"Tester\",\"add new workflow\":\"Add Workflow\",\"save\":\"Save\",\"Fields I can use\":\"Candidate Fields\",\"Config Transition\":\"Transition Settings\",\"Step NameAlias\":\"Step Alias\",\"QA Engineer\":\"QA Personnel\",\"is first step\":\"Step 1\",\"back to workflowlist\":\"Back to Workflow List\",\"default value\":\"Default\",\"step\":\"Step\",\"Step Remark\":\"Step Description\",\"Fields in this step\":\"Current Status Display Field\",\"Edit Basic Information\":\"Workflow Basic Info\",\"config display fields\":\"Configure Display Fields\",\"record value\":\"Field Value\",\"step alias name\":\"Step Alias\",\"Add Custom Field of story\":\"Add Custom Fields for #Stories#\",\"Others\":\"Others\",\"step original name\":\"Step Name\",\"Product Manager\":\"Product Personnel\",\"edit workflow\":\"Edit Workflow\",\"Add\\/Edit Custom Field\":\"Add\\/Edit Custom Field\",\"completed\":\"Completed\",\"Config transition append field & authorized user\":\"Configure additional fields and authorized users for transition\",\"Edit Custom Field of story\":\"Edit Custom Fields for #Stories#\",\"Status NameAlias\":\"Status Alias\",\"add workflow\":\"Add Workflow\",\"cc\":\"Cc\",\"is first Status\":\"Initial Status\",\"is last step\":\"Last Step\",\"Edit Custom Field of launchform\":\"Edit Custom Fields for Review Sheets\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"Statu