ve successful !\":\"Saved successfully.\",\"Add Sub Story\":\"Create Sub-Story\",\"Move\":\"Move\",\"Effort completed\":\"Completed Effort\",\"Story finished can not be splited into child-stories\":\"Completed #stories# cannot be split into sub-stories.\",\"Apply\":\"Save\",\"Save modify\":\"Save Changes\",\"Story in iteration can not splited into child-stories\":\"#Stories# added to iterations cannot be split into sub-stories.\",\"Back to list\":\"Back to List\",\"source\":\"Source\",\"Cancel modify\":\"Cancel Modification\",\"Status\":\"Status\",\"Modified\":\"Modification Time\",\"None-Category View\":\"Hide Category Tree\",\"Story finished can not be related with tasks\":\"Unable to associate a task with a completed #story#.\",\"exceed\":\"Extra Effort\",\"Story finished can not add timesheet\":\"Unable to add a timesheet to a completed #story#.\",\"Creator\":\"Creator\",\"Apply Category\":\"Batch Edit Category\",\"Developer\":\"Developer\",\"Completed\":\"Completion Time\",\"Business value\":\"Business Value\",\"Category View\":\"Display Category Tree\",\"Release id\":\"Release Plan\",\"Test Focus\":\"Test Focus\",\"Tech risk\":\"Technical Risk\",\"unfold all\":\"Show All\",\"Please choose stories or target category first.\":\"Select a #story# or target category.\",\"Story finished can not splited into child-stories\":\"Completed #stories# cannot be split into sub-stories.\",\"fold all\":\"Hide All\",\"Module\":\"Module\",\"Type\":\"#Story# Type\",\"effort completed\":\"Completed Effort\",\"Parent id\":\"Parent #Story#\",\"Feature\":\"Feature\",\"Copy\":\"Copy\",\"progress\":\"Progress\",\"Size\":\"Story Points\",\"Copy story title\":\"Copy Name and URL\",\"Cc\":\"Cc\",\"Iteration\":\"Iteration\",\"Iteration id\":\"Iteration\",\"Confidential\":\"Private\",\"Copy story title and link.\":\"Copy Name and URL\",\"Version\":\"Version\",\"No Data\":\"No data.\",\"Progress\":\"Track Progress\",\"Remain\":\"Remaining Effort\",\"Story with children stories can not be related with tasks\":\"A sub-story already exists. Unable to add more tasks.\",\"Category id\":\"#Story# Category\",\"Exceed\":\"Extra Effort\",\"Story with children stories can not be related with bugs\":\"Bug association is not supported for parent #stories#.\",\"Status owner\":\"Owner\",\"Priority\":\"Priority\",\"Owner\":\"Owner\",\"Id\":\"ID\",\"Please choose target category first.\":\"Select a category.\",\"Source\":\"Source\",\"Created\":\"Creation Time\",\"Hide stories category list\":\"Hide #Story# Category\",\"Remarks\":\"Comment\",\"Show stories category list\":\"Show #Story# Category\",\"Effort\":\"Estimated Effort\",\"Insert Summary\":\"Enter the name.\",\"Tech. Risk\":\"Technical Risk\",\"Edit Request\":\"Edit #Story#\",\"Create User Story\":\"Create #Story#\",\"Parent\":\"Parent #Story#\",\"Completion time\":\"Completion Time\",\"Exceeded effort\":\"Extra Effort\",\"Modification time\":\"Modification Time\",\"Value\":\"Business Value\",\"Remaining effort\":\"Remaining Effort\",\"Category\":\"#Story# Category\",\"Created by\":\"Creator\",\"Creation time\":\"Creation Time\",\"Est. start\\/end\":\"Begin\\/Due Date\",\"User Story Setting\":\"#Story# Settings\",\"Release plan\":\"Release Plan\",\"Saved Reports\":\"Saved Reports\",\"Only supports creation under the current parent project\":\"You can only create under current parent project.\",\"Basic Fields\":\"Basic Fields\",\"Est. effort\":\"Estimated Effort\",\"Insert Bug Summary\":\"Enter the bug name.\",\"Est. start\":\"Begin Date\",\"Notes\":\"Notes\",\"Edit User Story\":\"Edit #Story#\",\"Staff&Time\":\"Person & Time Fields\",\"Completed effort\":\"Completed Effort\",\"Est. end\":\"Due Date\",\"Effort Field\":\"Effort Fields\",\"Test focus\":\"Test Focus\",\"High\":\"High\",\"The hierachy of story tree has reached limit. System cannot create child story.\":\"The number of #story# tree levels has reached the limit. Unable to create sub-stories.\",\"Product belongs\":\"Product Family\",\"After saving story , the system will automatically generate sub stories\":\"Auto-creation of preset sub-stories has been configured for this template. Saving the #story# will generate sub-stories automatically.\",\"The amount of stories in this stroy tree is up to 200. The default child-stories cannot be created.\":\"The number of #stories# in the #story# tree of this #story# has reached the limit of 200. Unable to create the preset sub-story.\",\"The project you try to move story into has not been found\":\"No target project for the #story#.\",\", some default objects are failed to create. Failure reason:\":\". Failed to create some preset sub-stories. Reason for Failure:\",\"Project does not open task application\":\"Auto-creation of preset tasks has been configured for this template. But the system is unable to create tasks automatically because tasks application is disabled for the project.\",\"Be restricted by workitem type setting, System cannot create the issue of this type. You can ask workspace admin to change the setting.\":\"Unable to create a #story# under this category because of the category configuration. For any questions, contact the admin.\",\"%s Matching Results In Total\":\"%s Match(es) Found\",\"Duration\":\"Duration\",\"After saving story , the system will automatically generate sub tasks\":\"Auto-creation of preset tasks has been configured for this template. Saving the #story# will generate sub-tasks automatically.\",\"Notice: it is not allowed to copy the stories that are not in your access scope.\":\"Note: You cannot copy sub-stories that you have no access to.\",\"When use this template to create story, system will create default child story at the same time.\":\"Using this template to create #stories# will automatically create sub-stories.\",\"Save\":\"Save\",\"Severity\":\"Severity\",\"Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"Be restricted by story setting, System cannot create child story under current status.\":\"Unable to create sub-stories in this status because of #story# settings.\",\"Add Fields\":\"Add Field\",\"You do not have permission to create tasks\":\"Auto-creation of preset tasks has been configured for this template. But the system is unable to create tasks automatically because you have no permission to create tasks.\",\"preset workitems\":\"preset sub-workitems will be created.\",\"Be restricted by issue type setting, System cannot create the issue of this type.\":\"Unable to create a #story# under this category because of the category configuration.\",\"When the requirement creator has no task creation permission, the task creation in the preset sub object will fail.\":\"Only #story# creators who have the creation permission can create tasks for preset workitems.\",\"Preset Workitems\":\"preset sub-workitems will be created.\",\"Be restricted by workitem type setting, the issue of this type cannot be parent issue.\":\"You cannot create sub-stories under this #story# type according to the configuration.\",\"When use this template to create story, system will create default task at the same time when task app is enabled. If story creator does not have permisson to create task, default task will be failed to create.\":\"When the task module is enabled, using this template to create #stories# will automatically create sub-stories. Only #story# creators who have the creation permission can create preset tasks.\",\"The submitted default objects do not meet the system format requirements, unable to create.\":\"The format of the preset sub-workitem submitted is invalid. Unable to create.\",\"default objects\":\"Preset Sub-Workitem\",\"You can create up to three levels of preset sub objects\":\"You can create a maximum of three levels of preset sub-workitems.\",\"No other subtasks or requirements can be created under task type.\":\"You cannot create other sub-tasks or sub-#stories# under the task type.\",\"When the preset sub object contains tasks, make sure that the task application is enabled.\":\"Make sure the task application is enabled when the preset sub-workitems contains tasks.\",\"The story which don't need to audit will direct access to\":\"The #story# which don't need to audit will direct access to\",\"This template includes default objects. After story has been submitted\\uff0csystem will create default objects automatically.\":\"This template includes default objects. After #story# has been submitted\\uff0csystem will create default objects automatically.\",\"(|operator|) transferred a bug to a story. The resolution of the original bug is set to [transferred to story]. Please click (|object link here|) to see details.\":\"(|operator|) transferred a bug to a #story#. The resolution of the original bug is set to [transferred to #story#]. Please click (|object_link_here|) to see details.\",\"(|operator|) transferred a bug to a story. The original bug is closed, with its resolution set to [transferred to story]. Please click (|object link here|) to see details.\":\"(|operator|) transferred a bug to a #story#. The original bug is closed, with its resolution set to [transferred to #story#]. Please click (|object_link_here|) to see details.\",\"(|operator|) added an attachment to a story of (|current owner|) in TAPD workspace (|workspace name|). Please click (|object link here|) to view the story.\":\"(|operator|) added an attachment to a #story# of (|current_owner|) in TAPD workspace (|workspace_name|). Please click (|object_link_here|) to view the #story#.\",\"(|operator|) add a new comment to story (|title|). Please click (|object link here|) to view the story.\":\"(|operator|) add a new comment to #story# (|title|). Please click (|object_link_here|) to view the #story#.\",\"(|operator|) added an attachment to a story in TAPD workspace (|workspace name|). Please click (|object link here|) to view the story.\":\"(|operator|) added an attachment to a #story# in TAPD workspace (|workspace_name|). Please click (|object_link_here|) to view the #story#.\",\"The last task of story 