al List for Confidential Story\":\"Set Special List for Confidential #Story#\",\"You can set user groups that can access all confidential stories and user groups that can only access specified confidential stories.\":\"You can set user groups that can access all confidential #stories# and user groups that can only access specified confidential #stories#.\",\"User groups allowed to access all stories\":\"User groups allowed to access all #stories#\",\"Allow access only to user groups with specified confidentiality requirements\":\"Allow access only to user groups with specified confidentiality requirements\",\"The selected user group(s) can access all stories in the project by default. When the access allow list is set, the selected user group(s) will be added to the list automatically.\":\"The selected user group(s) can access all #stories# in the project by default. When the accessible scope is set, the selected user group(s) will be added to the list automatically.\",\"User groups allowed to access only specified stories\":\"User groups allowed to access only specified #stories#\",\"The selected user group(s) cannot access any stories in the project by default. Only when such a user group is added to the access allow list for a confidential story can the members of this user group access the story.\":\"The selected user group(s) cannot access any #stories# in the project by default. Only when such a user group is added to the accessible scope for a confidential #story# can the members of this user group access the #story#.\",\"Access allow list has been set. The configuration cannot be modified for the stories generated through sync replication.\":\"Accessible scope has been set. The configuration cannot be modified for the #stories# generated through sync replication.\",\"Access allow list has been set. The configuration cannot be modified for the stories inheriting the access control settings of their parent stories or generated through sync replication.\":\"Acc